<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.400" end="00:00:04.400" style="s2">Three years into my marriage to</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.700" end="00:00:05.699" style="s2">Alexander Warren, I&#39;ve been abducted 18</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:07.400" style="s2">times.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.699" end="00:00:10.300" style="s2">Every single time,</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.400" end="00:00:12.300" style="s2">he took his life on the line to save me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.300" end="00:00:14.300" style="s2">The worst time, he took a bullet to</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.300" end="00:00:15.899" style="s2">protect me. Three of his ribs were</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.300" end="00:00:18.600" style="s2">shattered, and he was stuck in the</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.899" end="00:00:21.899" style="s2">hospital for a whole month.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:21.899" style="s2">On my 19th abduction,</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.000" end="00:00:26.600" style="s2">But the moment I reach his door,</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.399" end="00:00:27.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woman gasping. And then I see Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.600" end="00:00:29.399" style="s2">wrapped around another woman.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.799" end="00:00:31.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you escape? Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.399" end="00:00:32.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He rushes over to check on me, claiming</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.200" end="00:00:35.099" style="s2">he&#39;d been drugged and that Lydia was</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.700" end="00:00:35.400" style="s2">only trying to help him. She even smiles</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.099" end="00:00:37.500" style="s2">at me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.400" end="00:00:39.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it isn&#39;t Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.500" end="00:00:41.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I slap her across the face, then grab a</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.500" end="00:00:43.200" style="s2">vase and throw it at her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.400" end="00:00:44.099" style="s2">Alexander shoves himself between us and</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.200" end="00:00:45.500" style="s2">grabs my wrist.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.099" end="00:00:47.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. I told you it was an</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.500" end="00:00:49.299" style="s2">accident. Stop losing your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.500" end="00:00:50.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He shoves me down hard. The vase</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.299" end="00:00:52.299" style="s2">shatters.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.799" end="00:00:54.400" style="s2">As my palm presses into the sharp</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.299" end="00:00:56.099" style="s2">shards, blood pours everywhere. This is</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.400" end="00:00:58.200" style="s2">the first time Alexander ever lays a</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.099" end="00:01:00.400" style="s2">hand on me, and he does it for the woman</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.200" end="00:01:02.500" style="s2">who drove my father, Henry Hayes, to his</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.400" end="00:01:04.698" style="s2">death. As Lydia walks out the door, she</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.500" end="00:01:06.199" style="s2">flashes a smug smile, leaving behind an</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.698" end="00:01:08.199" style="s2">absolute mess.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.199" end="00:01:09.900" style="s2">Only after she leaves does Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.199" end="00:01:12.500" style="s2">tries to help me up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.900" end="00:01:16.400" style="s2">I throw his hand off me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.500" end="00:01:16.400" style="s2">Right then, my phone buzzed with text.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.000" end="00:01:21.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last 18 abductions, including</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.199" end="00:01:23.400" style="s2">today&#39;s, were all my doing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.199" end="00:01:25.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband knew the whole time. He</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.400" end="00:01:27.699" style="s2">couldn&#39;t bear to see me cry, so he</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.599" end="00:01:29.800" style="s2">always gave in. As I stare at the</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.699" end="00:01:31.699" style="s2">screen, my eyes burn so hard I think</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.800" end="00:01:34.199" style="s2">I&#39;ll cry blood.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.699" end="00:01:35.800" style="s2">At that moment, my heart turns to ash. I</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.199" end="00:01:37.900" style="s2">decide to throw this marriage away and</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.800" end="00:01:39.800" style="s2">leave Alexander forever.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.900" end="00:01:41.900" style="s2">Dazed and numb, I stumble out of the</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.800" end="00:01:43.800" style="s2">building into the dark night.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.900" end="00:01:44.800" style="s2">I dial a number.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.800" end="00:01:46.199" style="s2">Daniel,</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.800" end="00:01:46.800" style="s2">is that offer you made before still on</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.199" end="00:01:48.599" style="s2">the table?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.800" end="00:01:50.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.599" end="00:01:53.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After the hospital patches up my hand,</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.699" end="00:01:54.800" style="s2">Alexander is already gone, leaving only</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.000" end="00:01:57.900" style="s2">his driver behind.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.800" end="00:01:59.992" style="s2">When I reach home, I sit on the couch,</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.900" end="00:02:02.892" style="s2">waiting for him the entire night.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.992" end="00:02:04.692" style="s2">At dawn, he finally comes back.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.892" end="00:02:05.992" style="s2">His only question is whether my hand</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.692" end="00:02:08.992" style="s2">still hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.992" end="00:02:11.792" style="s2">Alexander, aren&#39;t you going to explain?</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.992" end="00:02:14.792" style="s2">She&#39;s my sworn enemy. Three years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.792" end="00:02:17.592" style="s2">Lydia framed Dad, a respected university</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.792" end="00:02:19.592" style="s2">professor, for sexual harassment. She</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.592" end="00:02:21.792" style="s2">drove him to his death from a 30-story</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.592" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">building and left my mother, Margaret</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.792" end="00:02:26.292" style="s2">Hayes, mentally broken.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.292" end="00:02:28.192" style="s2">She&#39;s been in a nursing home ever since.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.292" end="00:02:30.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop dragging up her past.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.192" end="00:02:32.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He offers no explanation, only claiming</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.292" end="00:02:35.292" style="s2">Dad&#39;s death was an accident. And Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.692" end="00:02:36.792" style="s2">had already been expelled and disowned.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.292" end="00:02:38.592" style="s2">He tells me to stop clinging to old</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.792" end="00:02:40.192" style="s2">grudges. Then</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.592" end="00:02:41.092" style="s2">he drops a thick envelope onto the</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.192" end="00:02:42.492" style="s2">coffee table.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.092" end="00:02:44.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The divorce papers and financial</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.492" end="00:02:45.692" style="s2">settlement are in there. I&#39;ll give you</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.292" end="00:02:47.892" style="s2">whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.692" end="00:02:49.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My world spins out of control.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.892" end="00:02:51.792" style="s2">Everything I know feels like a lie. When</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.792" end="00:02:54.092" style="s2">Dad&#39;s reputation was ruined and Mom went</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.792" end="00:02:55.992" style="s2">insane, Alexander was the one who</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.092" end="00:02:57.792" style="s2">shielded me from the hate,</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.992" end="00:02:59.192" style="s2">pulling me out of that nightmare. For</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.792" end="00:03:01.492" style="s2">three years,</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.192" end="00:03:02.992" style="s2">I put all my remaining trust in him,</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.492" end="00:03:04.192" style="s2">believing he was a wall that would never</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.992" end="00:03:07.692" style="s2">crumble.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.192" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">You&#39;re really divorcing me for her?</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.692" end="00:03:12.292" style="s2">My limbs go ice cold,</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.692" end="00:03:13.992" style="s2">but I force the question out anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.292" end="00:03:15.692" style="s2">You&#39;re really divorcing me for her?</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.992" end="00:03:17.992" style="s2">Alexander&#39;s eyes hold nothing but</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.692" end="00:03:19.592" style="s2">establishment and fatigue.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.992" end="00:03:21.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sick of you using those abductors to</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.592" end="00:03:23.292" style="s2">guilt track me. Just sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.492" end="00:03:25.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He packs his bags and walks out the door</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.292" end="00:03:26.492" style="s2">right in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.092" end="00:03:27.892" style="s2">I sit on the couch and feel until</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.492" end="00:03:29.692" style="s2">sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.892" end="00:03:31.492" style="s2">The wound on my hand throbs, but it</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.692" end="00:03:33.492" style="s2">pales beside the pain of knowing three</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.492" end="00:03:36.692" style="s2">years of devoted love were wasted on a</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.492" end="00:03:38.892" style="s2">cruel lie. The next morning, a call from</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.692" end="00:03:40.892" style="s2">the hospital jerks me awake.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.892" end="00:03:42.692" style="s2">Mom has accidentally swallowed a lethal</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.892" end="00:03:44.692" style="s2">dose of medication and is getting her</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.692" end="00:03:46.392" style="s2">stomach pumped.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.692" end="00:03:48.892" style="s2">By the time I rush over, they are</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.392" end="00:03:51.192" style="s2">wheeling her out of the ICU. Her face is</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.892" end="00:03:53.592" style="s2">deathly pale, and a tube is still in her</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.192" end="00:03:55.192" style="s2">mouth. I storm into the doctor&#39;s office,</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.592" end="00:03:56.492" style="s2">only to find Lydia standing there in a</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.192" end="00:03:59.092" style="s2">lab coat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.492" end="00:04:00.492" style="s2">Her badge reads intern. Lydia claims Mom</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.092" end="00:04:02.494" style="s2">had a sudden episode and grabbed a</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.492" end="00:04:04.194" style="s2">handful of pills on her own. With last</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.494" end="00:04:05.894" style="s2">night&#39;s agony still raw, I slap her</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.194" end="00:04:08.594" style="s2">across the face. There shouldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.894" end="00:04:11.094" style="s2">loose pills in my mom&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.594" end="00:04:12.594" style="s2">You killed my dad</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.094" end="00:04:13.694" style="s2">and now you&#39;re trying to kill my mom</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.594" end="00:04:15.894" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.694" end="00:04:18.493" style="s2">call the police right away,</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.894" end="00:04:20.294" style="s2">her for attempted murder. the station,</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.493" end="00:04:22.194" style="s2">lay out every single sick thing Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.294" end="00:04:23.994" style="s2">has done, pleading with the police to do</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.194" end="00:04:25.494" style="s2">a full investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.994" end="00:04:27.494" style="s2">But as I step out of the interrogation</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.494" end="00:04:29.094" style="s2">room, the first thing I see is Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.494" end="00:04:30.994" style="s2">comforting her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.094" end="00:04:32.494" style="s2">When he turns towards me, his face</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.994" end="00:04:33.994" style="s2">instantly darkens.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.494" end="00:04:35.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lydia lost everything because of what</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.994" end="00:04:37.294" style="s2">happened back then. She&#39;s finally</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.694" end="00:04:38.694" style="s2">getting a fresh start.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.294" end="00:04:40.494" style="s2">Why do you have to ruin her?</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.694" end="00:04:42.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s your mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.494" end="00:04:44.694" style="s2">She drove my dad to suicide and tried to</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.394" end="00:04:46.494" style="s2">kill my mom. What right does she have to</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.694" end="00:04:47.894" style="s2">be a doctor? He looks at me like I am a</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.494" end="00:04:49.494" style="s2">total lunatic.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.894" end="00:04:51.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You framed Lydia.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.494" end="00:04:52.594" style="s2">I can&#39;t bail you out of this one.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.394" end="00:04:54.594" style="s2">Stay in a cell and think about what</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.594" end="00:04:57.994" style="s2">you&#39;ve done.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.594" end="00:04:57.994" style="s2">I&#39;m not letting you raise hell anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.594" end="00:05:01.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander actually leaves me locked up</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.094" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">in a police cell. For two days and</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.794" end="00:05:05.194" style="s2">nights, I&#39;m cornered, baused with</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:06.694" style="s2">boiling water and have my food tampered</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.194" end="00:05:08.394" style="s2">with, but I endure it all without</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.694" end="00:05:10.294" style="s2">shedding a tear.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.394" end="00:05:11.394" style="s2">On the day I&#39;m released, Alexander is</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.294" end="00:05:13.194" style="s2">waiting outside with a written</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.394" end="00:05:14.994" style="s2">statement. He wants me to admit I had</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.194" end="00:05:16.894" style="s2">falsely accused Lydia out of an old</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.994" end="00:05:19.294" style="s2">grudge. He promises he&#39;ll let it slide</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.894" end="00:05:21.094" style="s2">if I just sign it. And if I refuse?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.294" end="00:05:22.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t care about yourself, you</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.094" end="00:05:24.594" style="s2">should at least care about your mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.794" end="00:05:26.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hearing him use mom to blackmail me, I</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.594" end="00:05:28.294" style="s2">slam my fist into his chest. Back then,</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.794" end="00:05:29.894" style="s2">mom did everything she could to help him</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.294" end="00:05:31.394" style="s2">fight for his inheritance. Now he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.894" end="00:05:33.194" style="s2">using her life to force me to clear</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.394" end="00:05:34.994" style="s2">Lydia&#39;s name. Alexander grabs my</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.194" end="00:05:35.694" style="s2">shoulders. His tone turns sickeningly</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.994" end="00:05:38.094" style="s2">gentle.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.694" end="00:05:39.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do as I say, and your mom gets the best</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.094" end="00:05:41.294" style="s2">treatment. Otherwise, you&#39;ll have to</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.694" end="00:05:42.794" style="s2">live with the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.294" end="00:05:44.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A sudden cramp slices through my lower</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.794" end="00:05:45.794" style="s2">abdomen, almost folding me in half. Take</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.894" end="00:05:46.894" style="s2">me to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.794" end="00:05:48.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit acting, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.894" end="00:05:51.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s convinced I&#39;m playing victim again.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.894" end="00:05:52.394" style="s2">Right on cue, Lydia calls him, sobbing</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.094" end="00:05:54.394" style="s2">that people are cornering her and</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.394" end="00:05:56.694" style="s2">throwing rotten eggs at her. Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.394" end="00:05:58.694" style="s2">turns and walks away. I grab the hem of</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.694" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">his jacket, begging him one last time.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.694" end="00:06:01.294" style="s2">He just shoves my hand off and knocks me</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:03.994" style="s2">hard to the ground.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.294" end="00:06:05.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; doing things you&#39;re going to regret.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.994" end="00:06:08.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As his footsteps fade into the distance,</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.895" end="00:06:09.795" style="s2">before losing consciousness,</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.295" end="00:06:11.095" style="s2">I managed to dial emergency number</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.795" end="00:06:12.695" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.095" end="00:06:14.495" style="s2">When I wake up, a nurse nervously</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.695" end="00:06:16.195" style="s2">thrusts a form into my hands. You were</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.495" end="00:06:18.695" style="s2">pregnant, [gasps] but we couldn&#39;t save</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.195" end="00:06:21.895" style="s2">the baby. You need an emergency DC right</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.695" end="00:06:24.195" style="s2">now. Where&#39;s your family?</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.895" end="00:06:26.195" style="s2">In three years of marriage,</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.195" end="00:06:28.495" style="s2">I&#39;ve taken countless medications and</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.195" end="00:06:29.795" style="s2">seen countless doctors.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.495" end="00:06:32.595" style="s2">Yet I still haven&#39;t been able to</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.795" end="00:06:35.095" style="s2">conceive Alexander&#39;s child.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.595" end="00:06:37.095" style="s2">This child comes and leaves.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.095" end="00:06:38.795" style="s2">I don&#39;t have family here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.095" end="00:06:40.895" style="s2">I&#39;ll sign it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.795" end="00:06:42.195" style="s2">My hand trembles as I sign the consent</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.895" end="00:06:43.895" style="s2">form.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.195" end="00:06:45.495" style="s2">I don&#39;t even get the chance to rejoice</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.895" end="00:06:47.595" style="s2">over this baby.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.495" end="00:06:49.895" style="s2">When I wake up, Alexander is sitting by</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.595" end="00:06:51.595" style="s2">my bed. He thinks I&#39;ve just fainted from</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.895" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">low blood sugar and complains that I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.595" end="00:06:55.595" style="s2">wasting hospital resources. I knock over</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:57.095" style="s2">the glass of water he hands me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.595" end="00:06:58.295" style="s2">Unbothered, he just demands that he</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.095" end="00:07:01.195" style="s2">apologize to Lydia.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.295" end="00:07:04.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hired people to hurt her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.195" end="00:07:06.795" style="s2">Apologize, and I&#39;ll clear your name.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.295" end="00:07:08.695" style="s2">Your mom&#39;s condition is worsening.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.795" end="00:07:09.595" style="s2">Without money, she&#39;ll be thrown out of</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.695" end="00:07:11.795" style="s2">the nursing home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.595" end="00:07:13.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For mom&#39;s sake, I end up signing that</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.795" end="00:07:15.395" style="s2">apology statement.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.614" end="00:07:17.395" style="s2">[snorts] But once it goes online,</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.395" end="00:07:19.295" style="s2">Alexander uses his account to whitewash</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.395" end="00:07:21.295" style="s2">Lydia&#39;s reputation, claiming dad</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.295" end="00:07:23.795" style="s2">harassed her and hid his marriage to</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.295" end="00:07:26.495" style="s2">pursue her, painting her as the innocent</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.795" end="00:07:28.295" style="s2">victim. People outside my room point and</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.495" end="00:07:30.995" style="s2">whisper at me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.295" end="00:07:33.095" style="s2">The comment section explodes with hate.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.995" end="00:07:34.695" style="s2">Some call me a malicious [ __ ] while</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.095" end="00:07:36.895" style="s2">others say my family deserves to be</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.695" end="00:07:39.295" style="s2">wiped out. To protect Lydia, he doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.895" end="00:07:40.795" style="s2">just ruin me. He drags my late father</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.295" end="00:07:42.595" style="s2">out of his grave to humiliate him all</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.795" end="00:07:44.795" style="s2">over again. I shuffle out of the</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.595" end="00:07:46.795" style="s2">hospital like a ghost. After paying the</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.795" end="00:07:49.095" style="s2">medical bills, I don&#39;t even have enough</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.795" end="00:07:51.295" style="s2">cash for a cab because Alexander has</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.095" end="00:07:54.595" style="s2">frozen all my credit cards. A black</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.295" end="00:07:54.595" style="s2">sedan pulls up beside me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.895" end="00:08:01.095" style="s2">The back window rolls down, revealing</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.295" end="00:08:02.895" style="s2">Lydia&#39;s smug face. Want a ride?</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.095" end="00:08:04.495" style="s2">Alexander glances at me just once.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.895" end="00:08:06.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can walk back herself.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.495" end="00:08:08.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car speeds off, leaving me all alone</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.995" end="00:08:10.697" style="s2">by the side of the road.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.997" end="00:08:13.597" style="s2">I walk back to the villa in the pouring</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.697" end="00:08:15.097" style="s2">rain, soaked and shivering. Alexander is</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.597" end="00:08:16.697" style="s2">already waiting on the couch with a</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.097" end="00:08:18.797" style="s2">newly drafted divorce agreement on the</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.697" end="00:08:20.997" style="s2">coffee table. Seeing how pathetic I</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.797" end="00:08:22.997" style="s2">look, he assumes I&#39;m making a scene on</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.997" end="00:08:24.597" style="s2">purpose just to make him feel guilty.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.997" end="00:08:25.397" style="s2">Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.597" end="00:08:27.297" style="s2">why?</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.397" end="00:08:28.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I&#39;m sick of it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.297" end="00:08:29.297" style="s2">You&#39;re always wallowing in self-pity</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.997" end="00:08:31.297" style="s2">over</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.297" end="00:08:33.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then join her in humiliating me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.297" end="00:08:35.396" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lydia never demands anything from me,</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.097" end="00:08:36.497" style="s2">and she&#39;s carrying my child. I won&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.396" end="00:08:38.497" style="s2">her wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.497" end="00:08:40.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband is forcing me into a divorce</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.497" end="00:08:42.997" style="s2">for another woman&#39;s child, completely</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.497" end="00:08:44.897" style="s2">aware that he just killed our baby.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.997" end="00:08:46.997" style="s2">I refuse to sign. As long as this</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.897" end="00:08:48.897" style="s2">marriage isn&#39;t officially over, Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.997" end="00:08:50.697" style="s2">remains and warns me that if we actually</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.897" end="00:08:52.997" style="s2">take this to court, I won&#39;t get a single</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.697" end="00:08:55.197" style="s2">penny. I cling to his arm, reminding him</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.997" end="00:08:56.897" style="s2">of the 19 abductions I endured because</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.197" end="00:08:58.697" style="s2">of him, but he snaps that he&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.897" end="00:09:00.697" style="s2">paying mom&#39;s medical base and cleaning</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.697" end="00:09:02.797" style="s2">up my family&#39;s mess. I&#39;ve used those</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.697" end="00:09:04.597" style="s2">favors against him countless times. With</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.797" end="00:09:06.197" style="s2">that, he grabs his car keys and heads</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.597" end="00:09:06.897" style="s2">for the door. I chase him out onto the</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.197" end="00:09:08.397" style="s2">driveway.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.897" end="00:09:10.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t believe you feel nothing for me</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.397" end="00:09:10.997" style="s2">anymore. If that&#39;s how it is, then let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:12.697" style="s2">die together.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.997" end="00:09:14.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just then, a car comes screening</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.697" end="00:09:17.197" style="s2">straight towards us. Wiping away my</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.497" end="00:09:19.797" style="s2">tears, I hurl myself into the path of</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.197" end="00:09:20.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, are you crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.797" end="00:09:22.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander&#39;s expression shifts</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.997" end="00:09:24.097" style="s2">drastically. Without a second thought,</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.497" end="00:09:25.497" style="s2">he rushes towards me. He shoves me out</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.097" end="00:09:26.897" style="s2">of the way only to be struck by the car</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.497" end="00:09:28.897" style="s2">himself and sent crashing to the ground</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.897" end="00:09:31.097" style="s2">in a pool of blood. I throw myself over</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.897" end="00:09:33.497" style="s2">him, trembling with fear as I apologize</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.097" end="00:09:34.997" style="s2">over and over. Alexander uses his blood</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.497" end="00:09:36.397" style="s2">stained hand to grip my wrist tight.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.997" end="00:09:37.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I paid back the debt for those 19</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.397" end="00:09:39.497" style="s2">abductions. I don&#39;t owe you anything</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.897" end="00:09:41.397" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.497" end="00:09:42.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to draw a line between us that</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.397" end="00:09:43.797" style="s2">badly?</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.797" end="00:09:44.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.797" end="00:09:46.397" style="s2">let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.997" end="00:09:48.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With those final words, he loses</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.397" end="00:09:50.197" style="s2">consciousness. I stand watch outside the</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.497" end="00:09:51.897" style="s2">operating room the entire night. Yet the</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.197" end="00:09:53.697" style="s2">first thing he does upon waking up is</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.897" end="00:09:55.097" style="s2">grab his phone to comfort Lydia. That</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.697" end="00:09:57.297" style="s2">gentle tone completely shatters the very</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.097" end="00:09:59.697" style="s2">last piece of my delusion.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.297" end="00:10:01.897" style="s2">3 days later, Lena suddenly bursts into</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.697" end="00:10:03.397" style="s2">the ward and slaps me across the face.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.897" end="00:10:05.897" style="s2">She demands to know why I won&#39;t leave</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.397" end="00:10:08.297" style="s2">Alexander alone. I slap her right back.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.897" end="00:10:09.697" style="s2">Instead of backing down, she sneers and</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.297" end="00:10:11.698" style="s2">tells me that Alexander grew tired of</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.697" end="00:10:13.898" style="s2">this marriage a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.698" end="00:10:15.698" style="s2">He put me in this hospital and declared</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.898" end="00:10:17.498" style="s2">me his woman. She watched the whole</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.698" end="00:10:19.598" style="s2">thing and was so Your mom&#39;s condition</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.498" end="00:10:21.998" style="s2">worsened these past two years because I</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.598" end="00:10:23.698" style="s2">used her as my personal lab rat. I</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.998" end="00:10:25.498" style="s2">refused to believe it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.698" end="00:10:27.498" style="s2">So she deliberately lays out every</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.498" end="00:10:29.498" style="s2">single filthy detail.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.498" end="00:10:31.398" style="s2">I charge at her and we lock into a</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.498" end="00:10:33.198" style="s2">violent brawl. We fight all the way to</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.398" end="00:10:35.898" style="s2">the window. Lydia suddenly grabs my</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.198" end="00:10:38.398" style="s2">wrist and yanks me backward. I crash</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.898" end="00:10:40.398" style="s2">into the flower bed below. Sharp thorns</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.398" end="00:10:42.598" style="s2">dig deep into my arms and thighs until</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.398" end="00:10:44.398" style="s2">the pain nearly knocks me unconscious.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.598" end="00:10:46.598" style="s2">Lydia, however, hits the concrete</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.398" end="00:10:48.498" style="s2">pavement. Her screams instantly draw</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.598" end="00:10:51.398" style="s2">Alexander running. He bursts out of the</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.498" end="00:10:53.398" style="s2">examination room, runs straight past me,</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.398" end="00:10:56.398" style="s2">and carefully scoops Lydia into his</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.398" end="00:10:58.698" style="s2">arms, urging the doctors to save her. He</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.398" end="00:11:00.898" style="s2">doesn&#39;t spare me a single glance. I can</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.698" end="00:11:02.698" style="s2">only crawl out of the flower bed alone</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.898" end="00:11:05.398" style="s2">and limp to get treated, ending up with</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.698" end="00:11:07.598" style="s2">over a dozen stitches.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.398" end="00:11:08.798" style="s2">When I walk out, Alexander comes walking</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.598" end="00:11:10.798" style="s2">towards me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.798" end="00:11:11.898" style="s2">Just as a sliver of foolish hope sparks</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.798" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">in my heart,</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.898" end="00:11:15.698" style="s2">he grabs my injured arm.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.798" end="00:11:17.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pushed Lydia out the window? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.698" end="00:11:19.298" style="s2">completely out of your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.798" end="00:11:21.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I tell him that Lydia was the one who</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.298" end="00:11:23.398" style="s2">grabbed my hand first,</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.098" end="00:11:25.798" style="s2">but he doesn&#39;t buy it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.398" end="00:11:28.198" style="s2">He drags me into his car and takes me to</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.798" end="00:11:29.898" style="s2">the nursing home where mom is staying.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.198" end="00:11:32.498" style="s2">Mom is in a violent episode, but the</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.898" end="00:11:34.698" style="s2">doctors and nurses just stand nearby,</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.498" end="00:11:36.898" style="s2">waiting for Alexander&#39;s command.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.698" end="00:11:39.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put her on electroshock therapy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.898" end="00:11:41.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My body trembles. Mom&#39;s fragile body</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.198" end="00:11:43.798" style="s2">cannot withstand shock therapy. Forcing</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.498" end="00:11:45.298" style="s2">it on her will kill her. Yet Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.798" end="00:11:47.198" style="s2">just stares down at me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.298" end="00:11:49.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hurt Lydia.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.198" end="00:11:51.298" style="s2">Now face the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.398" end="00:11:53.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I demand to know if he let Linia use mom</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.298" end="00:11:56.098" style="s2">as a test subject. He says nothing, only</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.898" end="00:11:57.798" style="s2">ordering the guards to pin me down.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.098" end="00:12:00.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make her watch every second of it until</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.798" end="00:12:02.398" style="s2">she learns her lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.698" end="00:12:04.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guards force me to my knees before</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.398" end="00:12:06.898" style="s2">the glass, making me watch as they strap</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.598" end="00:12:08.498" style="s2">mom to the electroshock bed. Her screams</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.898" end="00:12:09.598" style="s2">tear from her throat.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.498" end="00:12:11.298" style="s2">Worse,</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.598" end="00:12:13.299" style="s2">the entire session is live streamed</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.298" end="00:12:15.599" style="s2">online. I pound on the glass, even</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.299" end="00:12:17.799" style="s2">dropping to my knees before Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.599" end="00:12:20.299" style="s2">but everyone here is on his payroll. No</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.799" end="00:12:21.899" style="s2">one dares to defy him. Right then, Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.299" end="00:12:23.799" style="s2">calls his phone.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.899" end="00:12:25.099" style="s2">The moment Alexander hears her crying,</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.799" end="00:12:27.699" style="s2">he turns around to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.099" end="00:12:28.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go. My mom is actually going to</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.699" end="00:12:30.299" style="s2">die.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.599" end="00:12:31.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t even turn around. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.299" end="00:12:33.999" style="s2">know how long passes before mom&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.899" end="00:12:35.899" style="s2">screams suddenly stop.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.999" end="00:12:37.699" style="s2">She passes out on the bed as the heart</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.899" end="00:12:40.099" style="s2">monitor&#39;s numbers plummet. The door</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.699" end="00:12:42.099" style="s2">finally opens. I charge inside to hug</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.099" end="00:12:43.699" style="s2">her, begging the doctors to save her,</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.099" end="00:12:45.599" style="s2">but they just look at each other and</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.699" end="00:12:47.099" style="s2">tell me Alexander ordered that no one</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.599" end="00:12:48.299" style="s2">perform emergency care without his</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.099" end="00:12:50.499" style="s2">permission.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.299" end="00:12:53.699" style="s2">I dial his number over and over again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.499" end="00:12:56.399" style="s2">He finally picks up on the seventh try.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.699" end="00:12:57.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please tell them to save her. My mom is</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.399" end="00:12:58.799" style="s2">dying.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.099" end="00:13:01.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you do anything other than play the</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.799" end="00:13:03.199" style="s2">victim? Lydia is traumatized right now</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.299" end="00:13:04.899" style="s2">and I&#39;m taking care of her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.199" end="00:13:07.199" style="s2">Stop calling me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.899" end="00:13:09.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hangs up and powers off his phone.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.199" end="00:13:10.499" style="s2">All I can do is kneel and beg the</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.199" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">doctors.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.499" end="00:13:14.099" style="s2">By the time a nurse realizes mom has</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.299" end="00:13:16.999" style="s2">stopped breathing, they rush her to the</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.099" end="00:13:19.099" style="s2">ER a few dozen minutes later.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.999" end="00:13:20.499" style="s2">The doctor walks out</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.099" end="00:13:23.599" style="s2">and shakes his head at me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.499" end="00:13:25.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry for your loss.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.599" end="00:13:26.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My world completely collapses at those</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.699" end="00:13:28.899" style="s2">words.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.899" end="00:13:30.799" style="s2">Alexander once promised we were his</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.899" end="00:13:33.699" style="s2">family and he&#39;d protect us no matter</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.799" end="00:13:35.299" style="s2">what. Yet in the end, mom dies by his</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.699" end="00:13:36.999" style="s2">direct order.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.299" end="00:13:38.699" style="s2">I sit outside the morgue for an entire</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.999" end="00:13:40.199" style="s2">night. At dawn,</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.699" end="00:13:41.999" style="s2">I numbly arrange the funeral</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.199" end="00:13:43.199" style="s2">arrangements and bury mom right next to</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.999" end="00:13:45.099" style="s2">dad.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.199" end="00:13:47.199" style="s2">After that, I sign those divorce papers</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.099" end="00:13:49.399" style="s2">and hand them over to my lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.199" end="00:13:50.999" style="s2">I don&#39;t shed another tear.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.399" end="00:13:52.599" style="s2">There&#39;s nothing left in me but pure</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.999" end="00:13:54.899" style="s2">hatred.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.599" end="00:13:56.899" style="s2">I regret loving Alexander and I regret</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.899" end="00:13:58.399" style="s2">marrying him even more.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.899" end="00:14:00.099" style="s2">Everyone used to call him the best</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.399" end="00:14:01.699" style="s2">husband in the world,</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.099" end="00:14:03.199" style="s2">but nobody knew he dragged me straight</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.699" end="00:14:04.599" style="s2">into hell.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.199" end="00:14:08.099" style="s2">The old me,</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.599" end="00:14:10.899" style="s2">who once waited for for him to save me,</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.099" end="00:14:13.599" style="s2">died with my parents. I spend three days</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.899" end="00:14:15.499" style="s2">compiling evidence of Lydia &#39;s crimes,</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.599" end="00:14:17.801" style="s2">including the abductions and abuse of</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.499" end="00:14:19.901" style="s2">mom, and hand the thick file to the</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.801" end="00:14:22.101" style="s2">police.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:24.501" style="s2">This time, I will make her pay for</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.101" end="00:14:27.901" style="s2">everything she has done. When I step out</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.501" end="00:14:31.301" style="s2">of the police station, night has fallen.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.901" end="00:14:32.601" style="s2">I dial a phone number I had never saved.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.301" end="00:14:34.701" style="s2">Daniel,</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.601" end="00:14:36.401" style="s2">I&#39;ve settled everything on my end.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.701" end="00:14:39.001" style="s2">Is that job offer you made before still</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.401" end="00:14:39.001" style="s2">on the table?</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.201" end="00:14:45.101" style="s2">When I step out of the police station,</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.401" end="00:14:47.601" style="s2">I dial a phone number I have never</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.101" end="00:14:47.601" style="s2">saved.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.601" end="00:14:52.201" style="s2">He is dad&#39;s former student.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.301" end="00:14:58.801" style="s2">Grandma&#39;s caregiver in Brighton</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.701" end="00:15:00.501" style="s2">and the last person I can trust.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.801" end="00:15:02.501" style="s2">Daniel, I&#39;ve settled everything on my</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.501" end="00:15:04.801" style="s2">end. Is that job offer you made before</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.501" end="00:15:06.001" style="s2">still on the table?</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.801" end="00:15:08.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already booked your ticket for the</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.001" end="00:15:08.801" style="s2">afternoon flight.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.101" end="00:15:16.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pack just a single suit</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.701" end="00:15:19.201" style="s2">aside from a few changes of clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.401" end="00:15:21.001" style="s2">It holds only a photo of my parents</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.201" end="00:15:23.601" style="s2">and the old birthday card dad gave me</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.001" end="00:15:23.601" style="s2">years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.501" end="00:15:30.301" style="s2">I leave behind every designer bag and</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.501" end="00:15:33.701" style="s2">piece of jewelry Alexander gave me along</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.301" end="00:15:33.701" style="s2">with every memory in that villa.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.401" end="00:15:42.301" style="s2">The airport announcement calls for my</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.001" end="00:15:43.901" style="s2">flight.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.301" end="00:15:45.601" style="s2">I pick up my bag and head for the gate</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.901" end="00:15:47.401" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.601" end="00:15:49.101" style="s2">As the plane takes off,</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.401" end="00:15:51.101" style="s2">the city outside the window shrinks into</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.101" end="00:15:53.601" style="s2">a blurry patch of colors. Dad&#39;s ruined</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.101" end="00:15:55.901" style="s2">name, mom&#39;s death, and my baby who never</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.601" end="00:15:58.201" style="s2">got to see the world are all left behind</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.901" end="00:15:59.901" style="s2">30,000 ft below.</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.201" end="00:16:02.201" style="s2">I know the scars on my palm and the</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.901" end="00:16:04.001" style="s2">trauma won&#39;t vanish overnight, but I</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.201" end="00:16:06.801" style="s2">still have the strength to keep moving</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.001" end="00:16:09.401" style="s2">forward. From this point on, I live only</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.801" end="00:16:09.401" style="s2">for myself.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.501" end="00:16:14.801" style="s2">Lydia suffered only minor scratches.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.001" end="00:16:16.501" style="s2">After two days in the hospital, she</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.801" end="00:16:19.402" style="s2">demands a trip to the beach to clear her</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.501" end="00:16:21.402" style="s2">head. Alexander agrees. He has always</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.402" end="00:16:23.802" style="s2">felt responsible for Lydia&#39;s public</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.402" end="00:16:26.002" style="s2">backlash, especially since she claimed</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.802" end="00:16:29.202" style="s2">she endured it all for love. Whenever he</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.002" end="00:16:31.102" style="s2">was with me, he felt suffocated, cold.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.202" end="00:16:33.202" style="s2">Over the years, Alexander&#39;s enemies</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.102" end="00:16:35.502" style="s2">targeted me to get to him. Each time I</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.202" end="00:16:37.702" style="s2">came home bloody after an abduction,</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.502" end="00:16:39.202" style="s2">he&#39;d feel guilty, but later</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.702" end="00:16:41.902" style="s2">he convinced himself I was using my</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.202" end="00:16:43.302" style="s2">injuries to guilt trap him. Lydia, by</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.902" end="00:16:45.102" style="s2">contrast,</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.302" end="00:16:46.702" style="s2">never asked him for anything. The first</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.102" end="00:16:49.102" style="s2">time they crossed the line was after a</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.702" end="00:16:50.902" style="s2">business dinner. Afterward, she never</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.102" end="00:16:52.602" style="s2">pressured him, which only made it harder</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.902" end="00:16:54.402" style="s2">for him to let her go. The more he</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.602" end="00:16:56.502" style="s2">compares us, the less he feels I</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.402" end="00:16:58.402" style="s2">understand him. Yet during his vacation</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.502" end="00:17:00.702" style="s2">with Lydia, his thoughts keep drifting</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.402" end="00:17:02.402" style="s2">back to me. Alexander brushes this off</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.702" end="00:17:03.602" style="s2">as nothing more than force of habit.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.402" end="00:17:05.102" style="s2">What if Claire refuses to sign the</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.602" end="00:17:06.902" style="s2">divorce papers? She wraps her arms</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.102" end="00:17:08.902" style="s2">around him, looking at her tear-filled</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.902" end="00:17:10.702" style="s2">eyes. Alexander gives his word.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.902" end="00:17:11.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she won&#39;t sign, we&#39;ll let the court</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.702" end="00:17:13.501" style="s2">handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.902" end="00:17:15.602" style="s2">I don&#39;t break my promises to you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.501" end="00:17:17.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Reassured, whispering that their baby</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.602" end="00:17:19.802" style="s2">must be eager to meet its father,</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.302" end="00:17:22.202" style="s2">Alexander forces a thin smile, yet deep</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.802" end="00:17:25.202" style="s2">down he feels no joy at the thought of</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.202" end="00:17:25.202" style="s2">becoming a father.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.402" end="00:17:31.802" style="s2">The moment the plane lands, Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.702" end="00:17:31.802" style="s2">turns on his phone.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.502" end="00:17:37.002" style="s2">While vacationing with Lydia, he</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.802" end="00:17:38.502" style="s2">promised not to check work messages. Now</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.002" end="00:17:40.002" style="s2">missed calls and notifications flood his</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.502" end="00:17:42.102" style="s2">screen, yet my name is nowhere to be</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.002" end="00:17:43.802" style="s2">found. It feels wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.102" end="00:17:46.202" style="s2">In the past, no matter what happened, I</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.802" end="00:17:48.802" style="s2">would blow up his phone repeatedly. This</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.202" end="00:17:50.702" style="s2">time, there isn&#39;t even a single text.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.802" end="00:17:53.902" style="s2">Just as he is about to call me, his</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.702" end="00:17:55.602" style="s2">lawyer reaches out first.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.902" end="00:17:57.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Warren, the divorce has been</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.602" end="00:17:58.102" style="s2">finalized. The documents will be</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.202" end="00:17:59.802" style="s2">delivered shortly.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.102" end="00:18:02.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take the girdle version of pension.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.802" end="00:18:05.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander freezes, unable to process the</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.602" end="00:18:06.902" style="s2">words. In his mind, I was clinging</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.202" end="00:18:08.102" style="s2">desperately to this marriage just days</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.902" end="00:18:11.902" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.102" end="00:18:11.902" style="s2">Why would I suddenly sign the papers?</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.202" end="00:18:19.402" style="s2">He remains distracted on the drive back.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.902" end="00:18:22.103" style="s2">After dropping Lydia off at her</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.402" end="00:18:24.303" style="s2">doorstep, he doesn&#39;t step inside. Aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.103" end="00:18:26.503" style="s2">you staying here? Alexander simply says</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.303" end="00:18:28.303" style="s2">he has work to attend to, then speeds</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.503" end="00:18:30.003" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.303" end="00:18:32.403" style="s2">He remembers me kneeling in the nursing</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.003" end="00:18:32.403" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.803" end="00:18:40.003" style="s2">Blood streaming from my forehead.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.203" end="00:18:40.003" style="s2">An inexplicable pan hits his</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.903" end="00:18:45.203" style="s2">He makes a sharp U-turn towards the</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.503" end="00:18:47.403" style="s2">nursing home. Sure, I&#39;ll be there with</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.203" end="00:18:49.003" style="s2">mom.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.403" end="00:18:52.403" style="s2">He even decides he&#39;ll forgive everything</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.003" end="00:18:54.403" style="s2">if I sincerely apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.403" end="00:18:56.503" style="s2">Yet when he arrives, I&#39;m nowhere to be</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.403" end="00:18:59.903" style="s2">found and mom&#39;s room has been cleared</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.503" end="00:19:01.903" style="s2">out. A wave of dread finally settles in.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.903" end="00:19:03.603" style="s2">Alexander grabs a passing nurse by the</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.903" end="00:19:05.703" style="s2">arm.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.603" end="00:19:08.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is the patient from this room?</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.703" end="00:19:11.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She passed away a week ago. Her family</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.003" end="00:19:11.603" style="s2">already handled the funeral arrangement.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.903" end="00:19:17.703" style="s2">When Alexander hears that mom is dead,</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.603" end="00:19:19.403" style="s2">he feels as if his world is caving in</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.703" end="00:19:21.603" style="s2">around him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.403" end="00:19:23.803" style="s2">Refusing to believe it, he storms</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.603" end="00:19:25.503" style="s2">straight into the director&#39;s office,</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.803" end="00:19:28.203" style="s2">throwing all the blame upon the</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.503" end="00:19:28.203" style="s2">hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.803" end="00:19:35.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother-in-law died and nobody had the</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.403" end="00:19:35.803" style="s2">decency to inform me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.703" end="00:19:40.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The nursing home director can only lay</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.203" end="00:19:42.403" style="s2">out the hard facts.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.803" end="00:19:44.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ordered us not to intervene without</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.403" end="00:19:46.103" style="s2">your command. We tried to resuscitate</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.303" end="00:19:48.303" style="s2">her, but years of heavy medication and</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.103" end="00:19:50.103" style="s2">trauma had already destroyed her body.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.303" end="00:19:52.003" style="s2">It was just too late.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.103" end="00:19:54.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only then does Alexander learns that</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.003" end="00:19:56.503" style="s2">while using mom as a test subject, Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.503" end="00:19:58.503" style="s2">had been abusing her in secret just to</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.503" end="00:20:00.403" style="s2">keep her quiet. Yes, he&#39;d agreed to</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.503" end="00:20:01.603" style="s2">clinical trials, but never physical</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.403" end="00:20:03.503" style="s2">abuse.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.603" end="00:20:05.703" style="s2">Yet because Alexander brought Lydia in</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.503" end="00:20:08.403" style="s2">himself, everyone assumed she was</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.703" end="00:20:10.503" style="s2">untouchable. No one dared report her, no</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.403" end="00:20:12.503" style="s2">matter how far she went.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.503" end="00:20:15.003" style="s2">What haunts him even more is the memory</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.503" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">of my last distress call. That day, I</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.003" end="00:20:18.903" style="s2">sobbed and told him mom was dying, but</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:21.403" style="s2">he assumed I was playing the victim</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.903" end="00:20:23.805" style="s2">again. Hearing Lydia cry beside him, he</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.403" end="00:20:25.905" style="s2">took his frustration out on me, hung up,</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.805" end="00:20:28.105" style="s2">and powered off his phone. Mom was my</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.905" end="00:20:30.305" style="s2">only remaining family in this world, and</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.105" end="00:20:31.605" style="s2">he severed my last chance to call for</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.305" end="00:20:33.505" style="s2">help.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.605" end="00:20:35.905" style="s2">Leaving the nursing home, Alexander has</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.505" end="00:20:37.805" style="s2">no idea how to face me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.905" end="00:20:40.505" style="s2">He chain smokes outside the villa before</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.805" end="00:20:42.305" style="s2">finally opening the door.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.505" end="00:20:43.905" style="s2">Inside, the massive house is pitch</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.305" end="00:20:45.705" style="s2">black, and there is no sound of my</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.905" end="00:20:48.305" style="s2">voice. He searches from the ground floor</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.705" end="00:20:50.905" style="s2">to the top, but I&#39;m nowhere to be found.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.305" end="00:20:50.905" style="s2">I&#39;m gone.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.905" end="00:20:56.405" style="s2">Looking around, Alexander realizes</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.005" end="00:20:58.305" style="s2">everything that belonged to me is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.405" end="00:21:00.105" style="s2">My clothes, photos, and belongings are</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.305" end="00:21:02.505" style="s2">gone as if if every trace of me has been</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.105" end="00:21:04.405" style="s2">erased. Panic sets in.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.505" end="00:21:07.005" style="s2">He still remembers how I stared at him</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.405" end="00:21:09.705" style="s2">when he first brought up divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.005" end="00:21:12.305" style="s2">I will never agree to a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.705" end="00:21:14.705" style="s2">Yet after Mom died, I signed the papers</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.305" end="00:21:16.805" style="s2">and erased myself from his world.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.705" end="00:21:17.905" style="s2">Alexander spends the entire night in his</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.805" end="00:21:20.805" style="s2">study,</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.905" end="00:21:23.405" style="s2">smoking one cigarette after another.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.805" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">He calls my phone 30 times until even</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.405" end="00:21:26.105" style="s2">the automated recorded message sounds</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.305" end="00:21:27.605" style="s2">hollow.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.105" end="00:21:29.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, pick up the phone. Didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.605" end="00:21:30.905" style="s2">say you&#39;d never agree to a divorce?</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.205" end="00:21:33.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The only response is the cold robotic</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.905" end="00:21:35.205" style="s2">prompt. Every text he sends sinks into</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.705" end="00:21:36.905" style="s2">the void.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.205" end="00:21:39.205" style="s2">The old me would never ignore him like</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.905" end="00:21:40.605" style="s2">this. At dawn, his lawyer knocks on the</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.205" end="00:21:41.405" style="s2">door and hands him the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.605" end="00:21:44.205" style="s2">certificate.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.405" end="00:21:46.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Warrens, the paperwork is complete.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.205" end="00:21:48.405" style="s2">As of today, your marriage to Miss Hayes</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.405" end="00:21:50.505" style="s2">is officially dissolved.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.405" end="00:21:53.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clutching that certificate, Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.505" end="00:21:55.105" style="s2">finds it hard to breathe. This divorce</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.005" end="00:21:57.405" style="s2">was what he fought for. He forced me to</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.105" end="00:21:59.505" style="s2">sign and begged me to let him go, but</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.405" end="00:22:01.205" style="s2">now that it is official,</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.505" end="00:22:03.205" style="s2">he feels as though a chunk of his heart</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.205" end="00:22:05.205" style="s2">has been gouged out. The divorce</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.205" end="00:22:07.705" style="s2">certificate is real,</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.205" end="00:22:12.305" style="s2">and I truly don&#39;t want him anymore. As</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.705" end="00:22:13.605" style="s2">he stares at my name, his throat bobs.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.305" end="00:22:16.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, you really don&#39;t want me</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.605" end="00:22:16.005" style="s2">anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.405" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only now is Alexander forced to face the</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.705" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">truth. He cannot bear to let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.005" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">Alexander tears the divorce certificate</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.005" end="00:22:29.806" style="s2">into shreds, refusing to accept that I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.506" end="00:22:32.406" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.806" end="00:22:34.106" style="s2">I swore I would never divorce him.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.406" end="00:22:36.306" style="s2">Leaving like this has to be just another</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.106" end="00:22:38.506" style="s2">ploy to get his attention. Yet over the</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.306" end="00:22:40.106" style="s2">next few days, no matter what he does,</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.506" end="00:22:41.906" style="s2">he thinks of me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.106" end="00:22:43.506" style="s2">used to drop off homemade lunches at his</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.906" end="00:22:44.506" style="s2">office every day because of his weak</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.506" end="00:22:46.006" style="s2">stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.506" end="00:22:48.206" style="s2">I managed his personal life so</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.006" end="00:22:50.106" style="s2">flawlessly that even his friends envied</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.206" end="00:22:51.706" style="s2">him for having a perfect wife. When he</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.106" end="00:22:53.206" style="s2">first talked about divorcing me, they</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.706" end="00:22:54.906" style="s2">tried to set him straight.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.206" end="00:22:56.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Messing around with side chicks is one</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.906" end="00:22:58.706" style="s2">thing, but Claire has stood by you for</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.706" end="00:22:59.906" style="s2">three years and never did you wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.706" end="00:23:01.406" style="s2">You&#39;re going to regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.906" end="00:23:02.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back then, Alexander sneered at their</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.406" end="00:23:04.306" style="s2">warning.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.406" end="00:23:06.706" style="s2">Now those words echo endlessly in his</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.306" end="00:23:09.206" style="s2">ears. He finally tracks down my best</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.706" end="00:23:11.106" style="s2">friend to demand my location.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.206" end="00:23:12.606" style="s2">She looks at him with nothing but sheer</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.106" end="00:23:14.906" style="s2">disgust.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.606" end="00:23:16.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you care where she is?</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.906" end="00:23:18.106" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think it&#39;s a little too late</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.406" end="00:23:19.806" style="s2">for that?</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.106" end="00:23:21.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander suppresses his growing</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.806" end="00:23:22.406" style="s2">impatience</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.106" end="00:23:25.506" style="s2">and insists that there must be a</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.406" end="00:23:28.406" style="s2">misunderstanding between us.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.506" end="00:23:29.206" style="s2">But she refuses to pass along a single</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.406" end="00:23:30.906" style="s2">word.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.206" end="00:23:32.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t you ruined her life enough? You</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.906" end="00:23:34.406" style="s2">ignored her after her miscarriage and</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.906" end="00:23:36.706" style="s2">blackmailed her with her mom&#39;s medical</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.406" end="00:23:38.006" style="s2">bills to take the fall for Lydia.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.706" end="00:23:39.606" style="s2">Lydia fell from the second floor and</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.006" end="00:23:42.906" style="s2">walked away without a scratch. You</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.606" end="00:23:42.906" style="s2">better check if she&#39;s even pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.206" end="00:23:46.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What miscarriage?</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.306" end="00:23:50.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My best friend coldly informs Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.506" end="00:23:52.306" style="s2">that I was carrying his baby, only to be</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.806" end="00:23:54.006" style="s2">pushed into a miscarriage and</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.306" end="00:23:56.806" style="s2">hospitalized.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.006" end="00:23:58.406" style="s2">With that, she turns around and leaves,</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.806" end="00:24:00.306" style="s2">too disgusted to spare him another</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.406" end="00:24:02.006" style="s2">glance.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.306" end="00:24:03.606" style="s2">He remembers panicking when I was</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.006" end="00:24:04.906" style="s2">hospitalized.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.606" end="00:24:07.506" style="s2">But after the nurse said it was low</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.906" end="00:24:10.506" style="s2">blood sugar, he convinced himself I was</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.506" end="00:24:12.106" style="s2">playing the victim and lashed out at me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.506" end="00:24:14.206" style="s2">He rushes to the hospital to pull up my</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.106" end="00:24:16.006" style="s2">medical records from that stay. The</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.206" end="00:24:17.906" style="s2">miscarriage diagnosis and surgical</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.006" end="00:24:19.106" style="s2">record on the page shatter his last</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.906" end="00:24:20.706" style="s2">shred of hope.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.106" end="00:24:21.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you tell me it was just low</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.706" end="00:24:23.706" style="s2">blood sugar back then?</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.906" end="00:24:24.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Miller instructed us to say that.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.706" end="00:24:25.506" style="s2">She claimed she didn&#39;t want you to</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.906" end="00:24:27.506" style="s2">worry.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.506" end="00:24:30.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lydia again.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.506" end="00:24:31.807" style="s2">She knew I was pregnant with child.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.007" end="00:24:34.207" style="s2">Yet she bribed the hospital staff to</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.807" end="00:24:36.107" style="s2">cover it up, letting humiliate me while</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.207" end="00:24:37.807" style="s2">I was at my lowest. Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.107" end="00:24:39.707" style="s2">immediately orders his team to pull</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.807" end="00:24:41.707" style="s2">Lydia&#39;s entire medical history. What he</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.707" end="00:24:43.707" style="s2">finds is even more appalling. Lydia was</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.707" end="00:24:45.607" style="s2">never pregnant. The entire pregnancy was</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.707" end="00:24:47.407" style="s2">a calculated scam designed to force him</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.607" end="00:24:49.207" style="s2">into a divorce. Alexander sits in his</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.407" end="00:24:50.907" style="s2">car for a long time, his mind consumed</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.207" end="00:24:52.507" style="s2">by thoughts of me. If both the pregnancy</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.907" end="00:24:54.007" style="s2">and the low blood sugar were lies, how</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.507" end="00:24:55.907" style="s2">many other deceits had Lydia pulled over</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.007" end="00:24:58.907" style="s2">the years? The moment he walks into his</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.907" end="00:25:02.007" style="s2">office, the door flies open with a bang.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.907" end="00:25:04.407" style="s2">Lydia bursts in, sobbing hysterically.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.007" end="00:25:06.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, you have to help me. Claire</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.407" end="00:25:08.607" style="s2">has lost her mind. She&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.707" end="00:25:11.407" style="s2">claiming I was the one behind all those</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.607" end="00:25:11.407" style="s2">abductions.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.507" end="00:25:15.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The moment Lydia appears in tears,</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.507" end="00:25:17.807" style="s2">Alexander&#39;s expression turns cold. He</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.807" end="00:25:20.007" style="s2">knows by now that hardly a word out of</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.807" end="00:25:22.207" style="s2">her mouth is true. The tears that used</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.007" end="00:25:24.107" style="s2">to melt his heart now just feel utterly</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.207" end="00:25:26.907" style="s2">repulsing.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.107" end="00:25:28.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly did Claire do to you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.907" end="00:25:31.107" style="s2">Spell it out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.607" end="00:25:33.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lydia launches into her sob story,</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.107" end="00:25:35.707" style="s2">claiming I framed her for orchestrating</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.307" end="00:25:37.207" style="s2">the abductions and hiring people to</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.707" end="00:25:41.307" style="s2">abuse mom and me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.207" end="00:25:43.407" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could I ever do such a thing?</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.307" end="00:25:44.807" style="s2">She&#39;s just jealous of of me and using</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.407" end="00:25:47.307" style="s2">this to win you back.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.807" end="00:25:49.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that, she throws herself into his</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.307" end="00:25:51.707" style="s2">arms just like she used to, waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.907" end="00:25:54.207" style="s2">him to comfort her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.707" end="00:25:56.207" style="s2">Instead of holding her, Alex Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.207" end="00:25:57.707" style="s2">Alexander shoves her away with cold</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.207" end="00:26:00.207" style="s2">disgust.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.707" end="00:26:02.907" style="s2">Lydia is utterly stunned. He used to</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.207" end="00:26:05.307" style="s2">believe her without question,</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.907" end="00:26:09.307" style="s2">but now the way he looks at her is so</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.307" end="00:26:09.307" style="s2">unfamiliar, it leaves her shaking.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.907" end="00:26:14.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, what&#39;s wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.607" end="00:26:17.907" style="s2">Don&#39;t you believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.207" end="00:26:20.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander no longer listens to her</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.907" end="00:26:23.707" style="s2">explanations.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.907" end="00:26:26.407" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only asking you once.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.707" end="00:26:30.707" style="s2">Did you or did you not</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.407" end="00:26:30.707" style="s2">stage those abductions and abuse her?</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.307" end="00:26:35.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lydia never</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.609" end="00:26:36.908" style="s2">Alexander would actually start</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.309" end="00:26:38.509" style="s2">questioning her.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.908" end="00:26:40.609" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.509" end="00:26:43.009" style="s2">Composing herself, she insists that</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.609" end="00:26:45.309" style="s2">abduction is a serious crime and she&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.009" end="00:26:46.709" style="s2">never do such a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.309" end="00:26:49.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re innocent, you have nothing to</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.709" end="00:26:52.109" style="s2">fear. Let the police investigate.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.709" end="00:26:53.709" style="s2">If Claire falsely accused you, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.109" end="00:26:55.709" style="s2">face the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.709" end="00:26:57.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knows me too well. Abduction is a</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.709" end="00:27:00.109" style="s2">serious accusation and I&#39;d never make it</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.809" end="00:27:02.509" style="s2">without solid evidence. During those 19</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.109" end="00:27:03.609" style="s2">abductions, every single episode left me</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.509" end="00:27:04.909" style="s2">battered.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.609" end="00:27:08.009" style="s2">Yet he could never track down the</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.909" end="00:27:09.809" style="s2">mastermind. If Lydia was behind them,</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.009" end="00:27:12.933" style="s2">then every bit of suffering I endured</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.809" end="00:27:14.309" style="s2">was enabled by his blind favoritism.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.933" end="00:27:15.909" style="s2">[gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.309" end="00:27:17.909" style="s2">Seeing that her tears are no longer</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.909" end="00:27:20.009" style="s2">working, Lydia frantically grabs</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.909" end="00:27:21.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if you don&#39;t care about me,</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.009" end="00:27:23.409" style="s2">are you really going to abandon your own</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.909" end="00:27:27.009" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.409" end="00:27:28.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander&#39;s gaze turns ice cold.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.009" end="00:27:30.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you really pregnant? Claire</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.709" end="00:27:32.009" style="s2">miscarried my child and you bribed the</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.409" end="00:27:33.909" style="s2">hospital to hide it while using a fake</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.009" end="00:27:36.209" style="s2">pregnancy to trick me into a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.909" end="00:27:38.709" style="s2">How many more lies have you told me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.209" end="00:27:40.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lydia turns deathly pale, but still</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.709" end="00:27:42.809" style="s2">blames me, [screaming] screaming that</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.609" end="00:27:45.609" style="s2">the online accusations are lies I</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.809" end="00:27:48.509" style="s2">fabricated for revenge. Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.609" end="00:27:50.909" style="s2">doesn&#39;t buy a single word anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.509" end="00:27:53.109" style="s2">Realizing she&#39;s cornered, Lydia screams</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.909" end="00:27:54.709" style="s2">that she might as well just die,</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.109" end="00:27:56.609" style="s2">blood streaming down her face while</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.709" end="00:27:58.309" style="s2">Alexander stands nearby, refusing to</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.609" end="00:28:00.309" style="s2">help. When did he turn into someone he</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.309" end="00:28:02.309" style="s2">himself finds unrecognizable? Our</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.309" end="00:28:03.809" style="s2">marriage should have been peaceful,</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.309" end="00:28:05.809" style="s2">but after I was repeatedly abducted</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.809" end="00:28:07.909" style="s2">because of him and came home covered in</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.809" end="00:28:09.709" style="s2">scars, his guilt slowly became a</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.909" end="00:28:11.109" style="s2">suffocating burden.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.709" end="00:28:12.909" style="s2">Over time, those scars stopped</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.109" end="00:28:14.709" style="s2">representing my suffering to him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.909" end="00:28:16.309" style="s2">Instead, they became a constant reminder</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.709" end="00:28:18.109" style="s2">of what he owed me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.309" end="00:28:20.009" style="s2">So he sought refuge in the ease Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.109" end="00:28:23.109" style="s2">offered, painting his betrayal as a</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.009" end="00:28:23.109" style="s2">momentary mistake</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.309" end="00:28:27.709" style="s2">and his escape as freedom.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.509" end="00:28:30.609" style="s2">Yet now, even the baby that drove him to</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.709" end="00:28:33.409" style="s2">demand a divorce was just a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.609" end="00:28:34.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only did it because I love you. If I</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.409" end="00:28:36.810" style="s2">didn&#39;t say I was pregnant, would you</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.810" end="00:28:39.010" style="s2">ever have chosen me?</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.810" end="00:28:40.910" style="s2">I just gave you the push you needed.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.010" end="00:28:42.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That confession confirms it out loud.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.910" end="00:28:43.910" style="s2">She was manipulating him from the very</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.110" end="00:28:45.510" style="s2">beginning, staring into the eyes that</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.910" end="00:28:47.010" style="s2">once softened him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.510" end="00:28:50.010" style="s2">Senator Alexander finally stops</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.010" end="00:28:50.010" style="s2">believing her tears.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.210" end="00:28:56.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the abductions?</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.510" end="00:28:59.410" style="s2">What else did you actually do to her?</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.810" end="00:28:59.410" style="s2">Declare.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.910" end="00:29:05.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Faced with Alexander&#39;s interrogation,</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.110" end="00:29:08.210" style="s2">Lydia bites her lip, refusing to speak.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.710" end="00:29:10.410" style="s2">Alexander stops pushing. Some truths</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.210" end="00:29:11.710" style="s2">don&#39;t need her confession. He&#39;ll have it</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.410" end="00:29:14.110" style="s2">investigated.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.710" end="00:29:15.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you still refuse to tell the truth,</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.110" end="00:29:17.410" style="s2">then you&#39;re on your own.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.910" end="00:29:19.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His mind drifts back to Lydia&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.410" end="00:29:21.610" style="s2">accusations against Dad. Seeing her</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.610" end="00:29:24.710" style="s2">repeat the same tactic with me, he</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.610" end="00:29:27.810" style="s2">realizes that accident was likely a sham</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.710" end="00:29:29.710" style="s2">too. Pathetic. Lydia cries and begs him</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.810" end="00:29:31.210" style="s2">to stay, but Alexander walks away</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.710" end="00:29:33.710" style="s2">without looking back.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.210" end="00:29:35.610" style="s2">Soon after, my attempted murder charge</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.710" end="00:29:38.310" style="s2">against Lydia explodes across the</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.610" end="00:29:40.510" style="s2">internet, affecting Warren Group. Nedius</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.310" end="00:29:42.710" style="s2">exposed that Lydia used Alexander&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.510" end="00:29:44.910" style="s2">connections to get into the nursing home</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.710" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">where she tested drugs on Mom and abused</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.910" end="00:29:49.510" style="s2">patients for years. Worse, when Mom went</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.710" end="00:29:51.410" style="s2">into critical condition, the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.510" end="00:29:53.110" style="s2">held back emergency recitation because</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.410" end="00:29:55.010" style="s2">of Alexander&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.110" end="00:29:56.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Using a living person for drug tests and</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.010" end="00:29:58.310" style="s2">denying emergency care when they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.110" end="00:30:00.610" style="s2">dying, that nursing home is more like a</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.310" end="00:30:02.310" style="s2">butcher shop.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.610" end="00:30:03.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Protesters gather outside the nursing</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.310" end="00:30:04.710" style="s2">home,</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.210" end="00:30:06.810" style="s2">and Warren Group stock tumbles</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.710" end="00:30:09.010" style="s2">overnight. Shareholders pile pressure on</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.810" end="00:30:11.010" style="s2">Alexander to kill the scandal. Yet he</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.010" end="00:30:14.110" style="s2">barely processes a single word of their</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.010" end="00:30:16.010" style="s2">outrage. Only one cold fact burns inside</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.110" end="00:30:17.310" style="s2">his head. The nursing home didn&#39;t kill</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.010" end="00:30:18.810" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.310" end="00:30:20.810" style="s2">He did.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.810" end="00:30:22.610" style="s2">As public outrage reaches a fever pitch,</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.810" end="00:30:24.710" style="s2">the internet unearths the old case files</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.610" end="00:30:26.710" style="s2">surrounding Dad. Alexander&#39;s assistant,</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.710" end="00:30:28.510" style="s2">Jack Rogers, flips to the final page of</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.710" end="00:30:29.410" style="s2">the court ruling and places it in front</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.510" end="00:30:30.510" style="s2">of Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.410" end="00:30:32.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The court cleared Professor Hayes of all</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.510" end="00:30:33.810" style="s2">wrongdoings long ago. Lydia fabricated</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.310" end="00:30:35.110" style="s2">the whole scandal just to extort money.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.810" end="00:30:37.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yet by the time that verdict became</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.110" end="00:30:39.011" style="s2">official, Dad had been dead for over six</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.111" end="00:30:40.911" style="s2">months. The public had long forgotten</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.011" end="00:30:43.011" style="s2">the resolution, remembering only Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.911" end="00:30:44.812" style="s2">as a courageous victim who spoke out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.011" end="00:30:47.011" style="s2">Jack lays down the newly uncovered files</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.812" end="00:30:49.312" style="s2">in front of Alexander. The truth is far</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.011" end="00:30:51.011" style="s2">more sinister than he ever imagined.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.312" end="00:30:53.411" style="s2">Lydia was the one who drugged Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.011" end="00:30:55.712" style="s2">The pregnancy was a hoax, and she was</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.411" end="00:30:58.212" style="s2">behind every abduction whose mastermind</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.712" end="00:31:00.411" style="s2">was never found. She abused mom under</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.212" end="00:31:02.011" style="s2">the shield of Alexander&#39;s authority.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.411" end="00:31:03.911" style="s2">When she fell from the second floor, she</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.011" end="00:31:05.911" style="s2">dragged me down with her only to accuse</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.911" end="00:31:08.312" style="s2">me of pushing her. Even the public</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.911" end="00:31:10.212" style="s2">harassment she claimed to suffer, being</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.312" end="00:31:13.011" style="s2">cornered and pelled with rocks and eggs,</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.212" end="00:31:15.312" style="s2">was entirely self-directed. Every piece</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.011" end="00:31:17.312" style="s2">of evidence converges on a single truth.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.312" end="00:31:18.712" style="s2">I was the only genuine victim. As</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.312" end="00:31:20.911" style="s2">Alexander stares at the chain of</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.712" end="00:31:22.111" style="s2">evidence on his desk, his face slowly</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.911" end="00:31:24.212" style="s2">drains of all color.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.111" end="00:31:26.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was never protecting a victim. I was</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.212" end="00:31:27.911" style="s2">enabling a murderer to hurt Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.212" end="00:31:30.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the price he paid was the loss of</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.911" end="00:31:34.111" style="s2">his unborn child. Now, even I have</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.712" end="00:31:34.111" style="s2">discarded him entirely.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.511" end="00:31:42.011" style="s2">Lydia is taken into police custody</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.111" end="00:31:44.212" style="s2">shortly after, yet she demands to see</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.011" end="00:31:46.312" style="s2">Alexander. Alexander no longer cares</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.212" end="00:31:48.312" style="s2">about her. He instructs PR to cut all</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.312" end="00:31:50.511" style="s2">ties publicly and cooperate fully with</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.312" end="00:31:53.111" style="s2">the police investigation. He will never</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.511" end="00:31:54.411" style="s2">cover for her again. Then he issues</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.111" end="00:31:58.111" style="s2">another order to Jack.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.411" end="00:32:00.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find Claire. The sooner, the better.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.111" end="00:32:02.611" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has so much to tell me. Even though</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.411" end="00:32:04.312" style="s2">I&#39;m disillusioned, he desperately wants</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.611" end="00:32:06.712" style="s2">to explain and make amends for</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.312" end="00:32:08.812" style="s2">everything he owes me. Yet Warren Group</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.712" end="00:32:10.611" style="s2">statement fails to calm the storm.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.812" end="00:32:12.812" style="s2">Netizens still condemn him for hurting</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.611" end="00:32:15.011" style="s2">his wife for a mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.812" end="00:32:17.312" style="s2">Ignoring the backlash, he heads to the</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.011" end="00:32:19.312" style="s2">detention center to see Lydia. When</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.312" end="00:32:20.911" style="s2">Lydia spots him, her face lights up with</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.312" end="00:32:22.411" style="s2">sheer delight. She assumes he has</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.911" end="00:32:23.712" style="s2">finally come to bail her out.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.411" end="00:32:25.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You brought this on yourself. You</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.712" end="00:32:27.611" style="s2">destroyed Claire&#39;s family and tormented</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.812" end="00:32:29.312" style="s2">her time and again. I&#39;ll make sure you</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.611" end="00:32:31.411" style="s2">pay back everything you owe her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.312" end="00:32:33.011" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hearing this, Lydia finally sheds her</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.411" end="00:32:35.411" style="s2">innocent facade entirely.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.011" end="00:32:37.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her mom died because of you. You ordered</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.411" end="00:32:39.212" style="s2">your people to give her a lesson and you</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.111" end="00:32:41.313" style="s2">banned the doctors from saving her. How</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.212" end="00:32:42.713" style="s2">dare you pin all of this on me now?</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.313" end="00:32:44.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She admits she has been acting all</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.713" end="00:32:46.313" style="s2">along, but insists that without</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.513" end="00:32:47.213" style="s2">Alexander&#39;s blind faith, she could never</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.313" end="00:32:48.613" style="s2">have succeeded.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.213" end="00:32:50.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m a murderer, you&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.613" end="00:32:51.713" style="s2">accomplice. You can&#39;t just wash your</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.813" end="00:32:53.013" style="s2">hands clean.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.713" end="00:32:54.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those words strike Alexander like a</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.013" end="00:32:56.313" style="s2">sledgehammer, shattering his last</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.613" end="00:32:58.513" style="s2">desperate defense. He looks at Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.313" end="00:33:00.513" style="s2">coldly, leaving behind a single parting</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.513" end="00:33:02.513" style="s2">line.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.513" end="00:33:03.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this moment on, whatever happens to</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.513" end="00:33:04.513" style="s2">you</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.213" end="00:33:06.113" style="s2">is none of my concern.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:07.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ignoring Lydia&#39;s hysterical screams</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.113" end="00:33:09.413" style="s2">behind him, he walks away without</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.513" end="00:33:12.513" style="s2">looking back. Right now, he just wants</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.413" end="00:33:12.513" style="s2">to know where I have gone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.713" end="00:33:17.513" style="s2">More than a month has passed since I</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.713" end="00:33:20.413" style="s2">returned to Brighton.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.513" end="00:33:22.013" style="s2">I&#39;ve been quietly recovering my health.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.413" end="00:33:23.213" style="s2">Yet while physical wounds heal with</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.013" end="00:33:25.713" style="s2">time,</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.213" end="00:33:27.513" style="s2">the pain of losing mom refuses to fade.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.713" end="00:33:29.313" style="s2">I&#39;m constantly haunted by the thought</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.513" end="00:33:30.913" style="s2">that my terrible judgment dragged her</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.313" end="00:33:33.113" style="s2">into this nightmare.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:35.113" style="s2">Whenever I close my eyes, the scene of</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.113" end="00:33:37.913" style="s2">her being tortured plays out all over</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.113" end="00:33:39.313" style="s2">again. Tonight, I dream of her again.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.913" end="00:33:40.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I beg the people around her to save her,</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.313" end="00:33:42.413" style="s2">but my pleas yield only mocking</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.813" end="00:33:44.213" style="s2">laughter. Not a single soul steps</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.413" end="00:33:45.813" style="s2">forward. In the end, Lydia plants her</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.213" end="00:33:47.213" style="s2">foot on my chest and looks down at me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.813" end="00:33:48.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you&#39;re fit to compete with me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.213" end="00:33:50.013" style="s2">I want you to watch the person you love</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.613" end="00:33:51.613" style="s2">most get tortured to death.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.013" end="00:33:53.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wake up screaming, my face completely</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.613" end="00:33:54.913" style="s2">drenched in tears. Even after all this</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.213" end="00:33:56.513" style="s2">time, that night remains burned into my</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.913" end="00:33:58.013" style="s2">memory. Mom was dragged down because</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.513" end="00:33:59.513" style="s2">they wanted to force me into submission.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.013" end="00:34:01.413" style="s2">At times, I wish I had died in her</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.513" end="00:34:03.513" style="s2">place. I pull my knees to my chest as I</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.413" end="00:34:05.713" style="s2">tremble uncontrollably. Suddenly,</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.513" end="00:34:07.613" style="s2">footsteps echo outside the door.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.713" end="00:34:10.113" style="s2">Someone pushes open the door, walks to</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.613" end="00:34:13.212" style="s2">my bedside, and gently rests a warm hand</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.113" end="00:34:17.313" style="s2">on my head. A deep male voice follows.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.212" end="00:34:18.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you&#39;re safe now. Don&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.313" end="00:34:22.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I look up.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.913" end="00:34:22.712" style="s2">Standing before me is Daniel Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.712" end="00:34:29.413" style="s2">The man who pulled me out of that</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.113" end="00:34:31.913" style="s2">nightmare is Daniel Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.413" end="00:34:34.913" style="s2">He was dad&#39;s star student. When dad was</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.913" end="00:34:36.513" style="s2">framed years ago, Daniel was abroad. By</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.913" end="00:34:38.712" style="s2">the time he rushed back, the damage was</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.513" end="00:34:41.013" style="s2">done. Later, Daniel played a massive</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.712" end="00:34:42.614" style="s2">role in clearing dad&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.013" end="00:34:44.414" style="s2">I chose to return to Brighton, partly</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.614" end="00:34:46.414" style="s2">because Grandma lives here,</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.414" end="00:34:48.214" style="s2">and partly because Daniel extended a job</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.414" end="00:34:50.314" style="s2">offer to me. He once urged me to build</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.214" end="00:34:52.714" style="s2">my own career, but I was too consumed by</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.314" end="00:34:55.414" style="s2">Alexander. To imagine our ending in ruin</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.714" end="00:34:57.814" style="s2">this time, I reached out to him. Though</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.414" end="00:34:59.614" style="s2">surprised by my call, Daniel quickly</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.814" end="00:35:01.114" style="s2">arranged my accommodation and brought me</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.614" end="00:35:03.014" style="s2">into Grant Group as his executive</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.114" end="00:35:05.214" style="s2">assistant. He insists he&#39;s merely</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.014" end="00:35:06.314" style="s2">repaying Dad&#39;s old kindness.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.214" end="00:35:08.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire,</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.314" end="00:35:10.014" style="s2">you have to let go of the past. My</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.014" end="00:35:12.314" style="s2">parents wouldn&#39;t rest easy</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.014" end="00:35:14.614" style="s2">seeing you trapped in that pain forever.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.314" end="00:35:16.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His voice is quiet, yet it unpacks the</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.614" end="00:35:19.314" style="s2">tension that held me captive all night.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.714" end="00:35:21.414" style="s2">He&#39;s right. No pain can bring Mom back.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.314" end="00:35:23.614" style="s2">All I can do now is live well. That was</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.414" end="00:35:25.714" style="s2">her greatest wish for me. That night,</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.614" end="00:35:27.614" style="s2">Daniel stays by my side. Seeing him put</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.714" end="00:35:29.514" style="s2">work aside to care for me, I pull up a</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.614" end="00:35:32.014" style="s2">chair and help him process files through</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.514" end="00:35:34.014" style="s2">the night. The next evening, I join him</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.014" end="00:35:35.814" style="s2">for a business dinner. The restaurant</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.014" end="00:35:37.614" style="s2">overlooks Brighton Bay.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.814" end="00:35:40.114" style="s2">Dusk settles over the water as the</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.614" end="00:35:42.614" style="s2">private room buzzes. When wine is poured</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.114" end="00:35:44.514" style="s2">for me, Daniel quietly replaces it with</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.614" end="00:35:46.914" style="s2">water. The gesture doesn&#39;t escape</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.514" end="00:35:47.714" style="s2">notice, drawing playful teasing from the</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.914" end="00:35:49.614" style="s2">guests.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.714" end="00:35:51.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Grant, you&#39;re taking such personal</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.614" end="00:35:53.514" style="s2">care of her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.414" end="00:35:57.114" style="s2">She must be truly special. Isn&#39;t it</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.514" end="00:35:58.314" style="s2">about time you had someone by your side?</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.114" end="00:35:59.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caught off guard by the sudden</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.314" end="00:36:02.814" style="s2">attention,</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.614" end="00:36:02.814" style="s2">I feel my face flush.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.314" end="00:36:07.714" style="s2">The guests at the table clearly mistake</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.414" end="00:36:10.414" style="s2">the nature of my relationship Daniel. In</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.714" end="00:36:13.014" style="s2">truth, they aren&#39;t the only ones. My</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.414" end="00:36:15.114" style="s2">colleagues had the same suspicions when</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.014" end="00:36:17.514" style="s2">I joined Grant Group. After three years</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.114" end="00:36:19.614" style="s2">as a housewife, my resume had a glaring</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.514" end="00:36:21.814" style="s2">gap. Yet I landed a role right beside</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.614" end="00:36:23.614" style="s2">Daniel. It hardly looks like a standard</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.814" end="00:36:25.914" style="s2">hire to outside eyes. Rather than</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.614" end="00:36:27.314" style="s2">letting the joke slide, Daniel clears</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.914" end="00:36:29.114" style="s2">the air seriously.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.314" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my mentor&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.114" end="00:36:33.914" style="s2">Her father gave me my break years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.514" end="00:36:35.514" style="s2">It&#39;s only natural for me to show her the</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.914" end="00:36:38.114" style="s2">ropes now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.514" end="00:36:39.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a single sentence, he clarifies my</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.114" end="00:36:41.914" style="s2">identity and shields me from any</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.914" end="00:36:43.514" style="s2">suggestive scrutiny. The dinner soon</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.914" end="00:36:44.816" style="s2">livens up again.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.514" end="00:36:47.216" style="s2">Having accompanied Alexander to</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.816" end="00:36:49.216" style="s2">countless gatherings, I&#39;m no stranger to</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.216" end="00:36:50.416" style="s2">such occasions and navigate them with</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.216" end="00:36:52.916" style="s2">ease.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.416" end="00:36:55.416" style="s2">By the time the party winds down, Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.916" end="00:36:58.115" style="s2">is visibly tipsy. I ask the waiter for a</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.416" end="00:36:59.916" style="s2">cup of warm water and hand it to him,</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.115" end="00:37:01.316" style="s2">but he just looks at me and smiles</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.916" end="00:37:03.016" style="s2">gently.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.316" end="00:37:05.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t take their jokes to heart.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.016" end="00:37:06.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually remembers that reef episode</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.316" end="00:37:08.816" style="s2">and worries that I might feel</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.516" end="00:37:11.115" style="s2">uncomfortable. I&#39;ve forgotten about it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.816" end="00:37:13.016" style="s2">I&#39;m not that petty. Only then does he</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.115" end="00:37:14.615" style="s2">take the cup and drinks it down in one</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.016" end="00:37:16.516" style="s2">guilt.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.615" end="00:37:18.216" style="s2">When he stands up, he rests his arm on</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.516" end="00:37:20.016" style="s2">my shoulder for balance, and I</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.216" end="00:37:22.016" style="s2">instinctively wrap an arm around his</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.016" end="00:37:24.016" style="s2">waist to keep him steady. Through the</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.016" end="00:37:26.316" style="s2">thin fabric, I can feel the warmth of</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.016" end="00:37:28.516" style="s2">his body alongside the subtle scent of</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.316" end="00:37:30.416" style="s2">alcohol lingering in the air. It&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.516" end="00:37:33.016" style="s2">until the valet opens the door that I</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.416" end="00:37:35.516" style="s2">realize how intimate we must look.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.016" end="00:37:37.816" style="s2">After settling Daniel into the car,</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.516" end="00:37:40.316" style="s2">I turn to leave, only to realize I left</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.816" end="00:37:42.615" style="s2">my phone back in the restaurant. I head</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.316" end="00:37:44.716" style="s2">back inside to retrieve it. The elevator</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.615" end="00:37:47.316" style="s2">doors slide open, and I walk straight</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.716" end="00:37:49.716" style="s2">into someone standing outside. I&#39;m so</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.316" end="00:37:52.016" style="s2">sorry. Before I can even finish the</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.716" end="00:37:53.416" style="s2">sentence, a pair of arms yanks me into a</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.016" end="00:37:56.816" style="s2">tight embrace.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.416" end="00:38:00.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, I thought I was hallucinating.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.816" end="00:38:00.615" style="s2">It really is you. Thank God.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.416" end="00:38:05.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The moment I hear Alexander&#39;s voice, I</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.516" end="00:38:06.216" style="s2">shudder and instinctively shove him</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.216" end="00:38:08.716" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.216" end="00:38:10.916" style="s2">This is Brighton, not his turf. I force</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.716" end="00:38:13.016" style="s2">myself to stay composed, refusing to</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.916" end="00:38:14.615" style="s2">show him a sliver of vulnerability.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.016" end="00:38:17.216" style="s2">Alexander says he guessed I&#39;d visit</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.615" end="00:38:19.216" style="s2">Grandma, so he went there first, then</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.216" end="00:38:22.216" style="s2">used every connection he had to track me</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.216" end="00:38:23.516" style="s2">to this restaurant. Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.216" end="00:38:25.615" style="s2">what do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.516" end="00:38:27.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want us to end.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.615" end="00:38:29.115" style="s2">I don&#39;t agree to the divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.016" end="00:38:30.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost laugh out loud at his words.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.115" end="00:38:31.816" style="s2">You were the one who demanded the</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.516" end="00:38:34.316" style="s2">divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.816" end="00:38:36.516" style="s2">When I disagreed, you threatened me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.316" end="00:38:38.316" style="s2">Now that I&#39;ve walked away, you track me</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.516" end="00:38:40.316" style="s2">down to harass me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.316" end="00:38:42.416" style="s2">Don&#39;t you find yourself pathetic?</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.316" end="00:38:44.316" style="s2">Panicking, he tells me Lydia was never</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.416" end="00:38:46.717" style="s2">pregnant and that all her claims were</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.316" end="00:38:47.717" style="s2">lies. He admits he was blind to believe</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.717" end="00:38:49.417" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.717" end="00:38:52.517" style="s2">Only after the truth came out did he</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.417" end="00:38:54.517" style="s2">realize I was the one he&#39;d always loved.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.517" end="00:38:57.317" style="s2">He even dares to bring up mom in an</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.517" end="00:38:59.217" style="s2">instant. The hatred I tried so hard to</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.317" end="00:39:01.917" style="s2">bury surges back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.217" end="00:39:04.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you mention my mom? She could</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.917" end="00:39:06.717" style="s2">have been saved, but you banned anyone</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.117" end="00:39:09.417" style="s2">from helping her. She was tortured until</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.717" end="00:39:11.117" style="s2">her very last breath. You and Lydia are</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.417" end="00:39:13.217" style="s2">both murderers.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.117" end="00:39:15.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seeing me lose control, Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.217" end="00:39:17.217" style="s2">doesn&#39;t step back. Instead, he steps</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.417" end="00:39:18.117" style="s2">forward and pulls me into a suffocating</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.217" end="00:39:20.217" style="s2">embrace.</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.117" end="00:39:20.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t hurt yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.217" end="00:39:22.817" style="s2">Blame me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.917" end="00:39:25.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I slap him hard across the face.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.817" end="00:39:26.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me. I will never forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.317" end="00:39:28.017" style="s2">You make me sick.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.417" end="00:39:30.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yet he acts as though he&#39;s completely</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.017" end="00:39:32.617" style="s2">deaf, pulling me tighter against his</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.217" end="00:39:34.417" style="s2">chest. No matter how hard I struggle, I</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.617" end="00:39:36.617" style="s2">can&#39;t break free.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.417" end="00:39:38.717" style="s2">Fear slowly tightens its grip on me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.617" end="00:39:40.917" style="s2">Just then, a crisp chime echoes from the</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.717" end="00:39:43.317" style="s2">elevator behind us. The doors slide</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.917" end="00:39:45.417" style="s2">open, revealing Daniel. The moment he</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.317" end="00:39:48.717" style="s2">sees my tear-streaked face, his</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.417" end="00:39:48.717" style="s2">expression turns cold.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.417" end="00:39:54.317" style="s2">Daniel doesn&#39;t give Alexander a single</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.117" end="00:39:55.717" style="s2">second to react. He lands a punch</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.317" end="00:39:57.217" style="s2">straight across Alexander&#39;s face,</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.717" end="00:39:58.917" style="s2">follows up with a sharp kick, and</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.217" end="00:40:00.017" style="s2">catches me securely before my legs give</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.917" end="00:40:01.917" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.017" end="00:40:03.877" style="s2">I break down, burying my face in his</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.917" end="00:40:04.417" style="s2">chest as I plead desperately.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.877" end="00:40:05.817" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.417" end="00:40:07.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take me away.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.817" end="00:40:09.317" style="s2">Please, I don&#39;t want to see him.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.317" end="00:40:11.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel tightens his grip before scooping</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.317" end="00:40:13.817" style="s2">me up effortlessly into his arms.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.917" end="00:40:15.017" style="s2">Before turning away, he glares at</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.817" end="00:40:16.717" style="s2">Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.017" end="00:40:18.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s with me now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.717" end="00:40:19.717" style="s2">Touch her again</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.117" end="00:40:21.917" style="s2">and I won&#39;t be so polite.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.717" end="00:40:23.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander tries to charge forward, but</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.917" end="00:40:24.717" style="s2">Daniel&#39;s bodyguards clamp down on his</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.717" end="00:40:26.317" style="s2">shoulders.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.717" end="00:40:28.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Warren,</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.317" end="00:40:30.417" style="s2">this is Brighton.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.317" end="00:40:32.317" style="s2">Mind your step before you do something.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.417" end="00:40:34.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car door slams shut, muting the</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.317" end="00:40:36.717" style="s2">outside noise. I curl into the corner,</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.517" end="00:40:38.217" style="s2">trembling, my hands and feet ice cold.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.717" end="00:40:39.917" style="s2">Alexander&#39;s appearance reopens that</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.217" end="00:40:40.917" style="s2">nightmare. Daniel doesn&#39;t push me to</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.917" end="00:40:42.917" style="s2">talk.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.917" end="00:40:44.117" style="s2">He simply holds my hand and rubs it</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.917" end="00:40:45.417" style="s2">gently.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.117" end="00:40:47.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.417" end="00:40:49.818" style="s2">He won&#39;t dare lay a finger on you again.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.917" end="00:40:52.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like a drowning person clinging to a</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.818" end="00:40:54.318" style="s2">lifeline, I grip his sleeve tightly,</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.418" end="00:40:56.218" style="s2">refusing to let go even after the car</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.318" end="00:40:57.718" style="s2">pulls up outside my house.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.218" end="00:41:00.018" style="s2">Daniel doesn&#39;t rush me or demand</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.718" end="00:41:02.218" style="s2">explanations. He carries me up to my</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.018" end="00:41:04.218" style="s2">room and sits quietly by the bedside.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.218" end="00:41:06.118" style="s2">Other than holding my hand, he makes no</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.218" end="00:41:08.218" style="s2">improper moves. Listening to his</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.118" end="00:41:10.518" style="s2">comforting murmur, I finally drift off</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.218" end="00:41:12.718" style="s2">to sleep. Unbeknownst to me, Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.518" end="00:41:16.318" style="s2">stays by my bed until dawn, remembering</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.718" end="00:41:16.318" style="s2">the summer he first fell for me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.518" end="00:41:19.818" style="s2">Only much later do I learn that Daniel&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.418" end="00:41:21.418" style="s2">feelings for me didn&#39;t begin when I</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.818" end="00:41:23.518" style="s2">returned to Brighton.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.418" end="00:41:25.318" style="s2">At 18, I saw him only as dad&#39;s star</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.518" end="00:41:26.918" style="s2">student and a brother figure. That</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.318" end="00:41:28.418" style="s2">summer, I painted in the courtyard while</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.918" end="00:41:30.718" style="s2">he watched from the second floor window</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.418" end="00:41:32.518" style="s2">for hours. Sensing a gaze on me, I</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.718" end="00:41:33.418" style="s2">happened to look up, locking eyes with</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.518" end="00:41:35.518" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.418" end="00:41:37.218" style="s2">To me, it was just a passing moment, but</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.518" end="00:41:39.518" style="s2">Daniel carried the memory of sunshine on</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.218" end="00:41:40.918" style="s2">my face for years. He leaves my room</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.518" end="00:41:42.918" style="s2">only when daylight breaks the next</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.918" end="00:41:44.818" style="s2">morning. Unaware of any of this when I</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.918" end="00:41:46.718" style="s2">walk downstairs, I lean against</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.818" end="00:41:48.518" style="s2">grandpa&#39;s shoulder like I always do. She</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.718" end="00:41:49.618" style="s2">pats my back gently and scolds me with</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.518" end="00:41:51.618" style="s2">concern.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.618" end="00:41:53.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always put on a brave front. You</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.618" end="00:41:55.518" style="s2">were crying so hard last night. Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.818" end="00:41:57.318" style="s2">stayed up all night watching over you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.518" end="00:41:58.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I freeze in place. The warmth and</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.318" end="00:42:00.218" style="s2">comfort I thought I had imagined in a</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.718" end="00:42:01.918" style="s2">dream were real all along.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.218" end="00:42:04.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa says Daniel is distant with</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.918" end="00:42:05.918" style="s2">everyone but me, urging me not to let go</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.218" end="00:42:08.318" style="s2">on someone who truly cares for me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.918" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, stop teasing me. He&#39;s just my</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.318" end="00:42:12.218" style="s2">boss.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.218" end="00:42:14.218" style="s2">I lower my head to eat, afraid to let my</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.218" end="00:42:15.918" style="s2">thoughts wander any further. Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.218" end="00:42:17.618" style="s2">comes from an extraordinary background</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.918" end="00:42:18.818" style="s2">and could have anyone. Why would he</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.618" end="00:42:20.318" style="s2">choose me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.818" end="00:42:22.518" style="s2">Besides, after barely escaping a</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.318" end="00:42:23.718" style="s2">marriage that broke me. After breakfast,</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.518" end="00:42:25.418" style="s2">I pack my have the strength to start</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.718" end="00:42:27.418" style="s2">over. Not long after hitting the main</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.418" end="00:42:28.918" style="s2">road, I notice a car tailing me. No</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.418" end="00:42:31.518" style="s2">matter how many turns I make, it stays</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.918" end="00:42:33.218" style="s2">right behind me. Panic sets in. My heart</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.518" end="00:42:34.218" style="s2">pounds as I floor the gas, desperate to</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.218" end="00:42:35.218" style="s2">lose it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.218" end="00:42:37.018" style="s2">Yet the moment I rush through an</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.218" end="00:42:39.118" style="s2">intersection, another vehicle speeds out</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.018" end="00:42:41.818" style="s2">from the side. A deafening horn blares</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.118" end="00:42:41.818" style="s2">into my ears.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.218" end="00:42:47.618" style="s2">I look through the shattered window and</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.018" end="00:42:49.618" style="s2">spot Alexander sprinting toward me. When</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.618" end="00:42:51.720" style="s2">I open my eyes again, I&#39;m lying in in</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.618" end="00:42:53.720" style="s2">hospital bed. Seeing Daniel beside me</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.720" end="00:42:56.120" style="s2">miraculously eases the suffocating fear</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.720" end="00:42:57.220" style="s2">in my chest. He leans in right away and</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.120" end="00:42:59.620" style="s2">says softly.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.220" end="00:43:01.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. It&#39;s not serious. Follow</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.620" end="00:43:03.120" style="s2">the doctor&#39;s advice and rest. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.620" end="00:43:05.220" style="s2">recover soon.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.120" end="00:43:07.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.220" end="00:43:09.320" style="s2">He was following me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.220" end="00:43:12.120" style="s2">Daniel&#39;s eyes darken instantly, though</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.320" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">he restrains his temper in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.120" end="00:43:15.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The police are handling the</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.220" end="00:43:16.020" style="s2">investigation. He won&#39;t get away with</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.120" end="00:43:17.520" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.020" end="00:43:19.220" style="s2">Just focus on your recovery.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.520" end="00:43:21.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Throughout my week in the hospital, he</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.220" end="00:43:23.420" style="s2">puts most of his work aside to stay by</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.120" end="00:43:25.120" style="s2">my side, refusing to leave despite my</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.420" end="00:43:27.920" style="s2">protests.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.120" end="00:43:29.920" style="s2">He always senses my unspoken anxieties.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.920" end="00:43:32.620" style="s2">With him around, I don&#39;t need to explain</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.920" end="00:43:34.420" style="s2">myself repeatedly or force a brave face.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.620" end="00:43:36.620" style="s2">A week later, I&#39;m finally cleared for</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.420" end="00:43:38.520" style="s2">discharge. Since my leg hasn&#39;t fully</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.620" end="00:43:40.420" style="s2">healed, Daniel carries me out on his</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.520" end="00:43:42.120" style="s2">back. Just as we reach the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.420" end="00:43:44.720" style="s2">entrance, his steps come to a sudden</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.120" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">halt. I follow his gaze and look up,</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.720" end="00:43:49.420" style="s2">only to see Alexander fresh out of the</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.720" end="00:43:49.420" style="s2">police station.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.620" end="00:43:55.220" style="s2">The moment I spot Alexander, my arms</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.120" end="00:43:57.320" style="s2">wrap around Daniel&#39;s neck tightens and</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.220" end="00:43:59.820" style="s2">my body freezes up.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.320" end="00:44:02.020" style="s2">Daniel notices my tension right away.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.820" end="00:44:04.120" style="s2">Rather than setting me down, he glares</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.020" end="00:44:06.420" style="s2">at Alexander and shifts his stance to</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.120" end="00:44:09.020" style="s2">keep me firmly shielded. Alexander&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.420" end="00:44:09.720" style="s2">eyes, however, remain glued entirely to</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.020" end="00:44:12.220" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.720" end="00:44:13.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, are you okay? I&#39;m so sorry. I</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.220" end="00:44:15.520" style="s2">only followed you because I wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.820" end="00:44:17.620" style="s2">talk. I never meant to hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.520" end="00:44:19.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s always like this. He says he won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.620" end="00:44:21.520" style="s2">hurt me, yet what he does grows more</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.420" end="00:44:23.420" style="s2">terrifying each time. Perhaps I was too</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.520" end="00:44:25.120" style="s2">submissive in the past, making him</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.420" end="00:44:26.620" style="s2">believe I&#39;d always stay no matter what</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.120" end="00:44:28.520" style="s2">he did.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.620" end="00:44:30.820" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to see you ever again.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.520" end="00:44:31.920" style="s2">We&#39;re divorced. Stop showing up in front</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.820" end="00:44:34.120" style="s2">of me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.920" end="00:44:36.020" style="s2">Alexander takes a step closer and his</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.120" end="00:44:38.120" style="s2">tone drips with self-pity.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.020" end="00:44:39.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used to say everyone makes mistakes.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.120" end="00:44:41.320" style="s2">Why can&#39;t you give me one chance to make</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.720" end="00:44:43.520" style="s2">things right?</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.320" end="00:44:46.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I look at him, suddenly realizing that</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.520" end="00:44:48.120" style="s2">running away is pointless.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.320" end="00:44:49.620" style="s2">Daniel, please put me down. Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.120" end="00:44:51.320" style="s2">hesitates, his eyes swimming with</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.620" end="00:44:52.820" style="s2">concern, knowing he fears Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.320" end="00:44:54.621" style="s2">might hurt me again. I offer a soft</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.820" end="00:44:56.821" style="s2">explanation. This is between him and me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.621" end="00:44:58.721" style="s2">It has to be settled once and for all.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.821" end="00:45:01.121" style="s2">After a long silence,</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.721" end="00:45:03.921" style="s2">he respects my decision, gently setting</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.121" end="00:45:06.021" style="s2">me down and stepping back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.921" end="00:45:08.521" style="s2">He neither makes decisions on my behalf</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.021" end="00:45:10.621" style="s2">nor walks away.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.521" end="00:45:12.221" style="s2">Seeing this, Alexander tries to step</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.621" end="00:45:14.321" style="s2">closer again,</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.221" end="00:45:17.621" style="s2">but I instinctively take a step back to</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.321" end="00:45:17.621" style="s2">keep a distance between us.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.121" end="00:45:23.921" style="s2">Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.121" end="00:45:23.921" style="s2">let&#39;s settle this once and for all.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.421" end="00:45:29.521" style="s2">I tell Alexander that we no longer share</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.321" end="00:45:31.621" style="s2">any connection whatsoever. He demanded</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.521" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">the divorce. I simply accepted his</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.621" end="00:45:35.821" style="s2">demand in the end. I offered him</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.621" end="00:45:38.021" style="s2">countless chances in the past, yet he</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.821" end="00:45:39.421" style="s2">pushed me away time and again.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.021" end="00:45:40.721" style="s2">Who is this sudden show of regret meant</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.421" end="00:45:42.421" style="s2">to fool now?</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.721" end="00:45:43.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I truly regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.421" end="00:45:46.521" style="s2">If you just come back, I swear I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.921" end="00:45:50.321" style="s2">treat you right.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.521" end="00:45:50.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I held like a better better life.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.721" end="00:45:53.621" style="s2">Do you think I would ever trust you</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.021" end="00:45:55.221" style="s2">again? When I lost our baby and</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.621" end="00:45:56.721" style="s2">underwent surgery alone, he claimed I</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.221" end="00:45:57.921" style="s2">was faking it. When Lydia pushed me from</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.721" end="00:45:59.921" style="s2">the window, he insisted I was the</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.921" end="00:46:01.521" style="s2">perpetrator. To avenge her, he let Lydia</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.921" end="00:46:03.121" style="s2">use mom for drug trials, watched her</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.521" end="00:46:04.621" style="s2">condition deteriorate, then ordered her</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.121" end="00:46:06.221" style="s2">medical care withheld until she died</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.621" end="00:46:08.221" style="s2">before my eyes. Every one of these</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.221" end="00:46:10.121" style="s2">atrocities was his doing. I once fell to</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.221" end="00:46:12.121" style="s2">my knees and begged him. I offered him</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.121" end="00:46:13.421" style="s2">countless opportunities to turn back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.121" end="00:46:15.421" style="s2">Yet he found me nothing short of</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.421" end="00:46:17.321" style="s2">repulsing. Alexander tries to claim he</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.421" end="00:46:19.121" style="s2">was manipulated by Lydia. Stop dumping</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.321" end="00:46:20.421" style="s2">all the blame to others. She was ever</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.121" end="00:46:22.221" style="s2">emboldened to hurt me because you</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.421" end="00:46:22.821" style="s2">enabled her. You were never the victim</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.221" end="00:46:24.521" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.821" end="00:46:26.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lydia has gotten what she deserved and</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.521" end="00:46:28.721" style="s2">will pay for it in prison.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.221" end="00:46:30.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yet he deserves zero credit.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.721" end="00:46:32.321" style="s2">Before leaving, I handed all the</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.621" end="00:46:34.421" style="s2">evidence to my lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.321" end="00:46:36.621" style="s2">Lydia&#39;s downfall today is something I</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.421" end="00:46:38.621" style="s2">fought for myself. It has nothing to do</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.621" end="00:46:40.521" style="s2">with Alexander. Out of the corner of my</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.621" end="00:46:42.221" style="s2">eye, I see Daniel take a call nearby. He</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.521" end="00:46:43.921" style="s2">doesn&#39;t interrupt or push me, leaving me</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.221" end="00:46:45.521" style="s2">complete freedom to decide. Though we</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.921" end="00:46:47.221" style="s2">though we rarely met over the years, he</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.521" end="00:46:48.821" style="s2">always seems to read my thoughts. He</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.221" end="00:46:50.221" style="s2">knows with one look whether I needed him</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.821" end="00:46:52.221" style="s2">beside me. When I look back at</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.221" end="00:46:53.921" style="s2">Alexander, the struggle I once felt is</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.221" end="00:46:55.921" style="s2">gone. It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.921" end="00:46:58.122" style="s2">This is where we part ways. Just let me</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.921" end="00:47:00.122" style="s2">go. With that, I turn around and walk</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.122" end="00:47:01.922" style="s2">toward Daniel. This time, Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.122" end="00:47:03.722" style="s2">doesn&#39;t run after me. He can only stand</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.922" end="00:47:05.722" style="s2">rooted to the plot, watching helplessly</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.722" end="00:47:07.222" style="s2">as I step into the car with another man.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.722" end="00:47:09.822" style="s2">He has lost the privilege to reach for</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.222" end="00:47:09.822" style="s2">my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.922" end="00:47:14.222" style="s2">Following my discharge, I spend a month</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.722" end="00:47:15.822" style="s2">at Grandma&#39;s house recovering. During</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.222" end="00:47:17.222" style="s2">that time, I stay by her side every day,</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.822" end="00:47:19.222" style="s2">free from walking on eggshells or</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.222" end="00:47:21.022" style="s2">catering to anyone. I haven&#39;t felt this</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.222" end="00:47:22.722" style="s2">peaceful in years. Daniel visits every</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.022" end="00:47:24.422" style="s2">day. No matter how busy, he makes time</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.722" end="00:47:26.122" style="s2">to check if I&#39;m eating well and healing.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.422" end="00:47:27.622" style="s2">Even if I say I&#39;m fine, he knows whether</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.122" end="00:47:29.022" style="s2">I mean it or I&#39;m just pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.622" end="00:47:30.722" style="s2">Grandma remarks that only someone who</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.022" end="00:47:32.622" style="s2">truly treasures a person could pay such</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.722" end="00:47:34.522" style="s2">attention to detail. I constantly remind</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.622" end="00:47:36.122" style="s2">myself to overthink things. The gap</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.522" end="00:47:38.222" style="s2">between Daniel and me feels so vast that</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.122" end="00:47:39.822" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know how to bridge it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.222" end="00:47:40.422" style="s2">Yet Grandma&#39;s next words cause my heart</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.822" end="00:47:41.922" style="s2">to skip a beat.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.422" end="00:47:43.522" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When your dad was in trouble, Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.922" end="00:47:45.222" style="s2">went all out to help. Did you really</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.522" end="00:47:46.522" style="s2">think it was just gratitude?</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.222" end="00:47:48.022" style="s2">He didn&#39;t care for me all these years</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.522" end="00:47:49.522" style="s2">just to repay a favor either.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.022" end="00:47:51.322" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only then do I learn that while Grandma</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.522" end="00:47:53.322" style="s2">lived alone in Brighton, Daniel cared</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.322" end="00:47:55.322" style="s2">for her. He scheduled her checkups,</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.322" end="00:47:57.222" style="s2">handled household chores, and even</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.322" end="00:47:58.522" style="s2">memorized her medication schedule. She</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.222" end="00:48:00.022" style="s2">adds that when I told Daniel I was</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.522" end="00:48:01.722" style="s2">moving back to Brighton, he ran over to</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.022" end="00:48:03.822" style="s2">share the news, beaming like a joyful</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.722" end="00:48:04.222" style="s2">child. She&#39;d never seen him so openly</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.822" end="00:48:05.722" style="s2">happy.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.222" end="00:48:07.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s laid his heart bare in front of</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.722" end="00:48:10.622" style="s2">you. If you share his feelings, pulling</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.922" end="00:48:12.022" style="s2">back. If not, make it clear so he won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.622" end="00:48:14.922" style="s2">keep waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.022" end="00:48:16.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma doesn&#39;t force me into anything,</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.922" end="00:48:18.722" style="s2">yet compels me to confront my true</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.622" end="00:48:21.022" style="s2">feelings. That night, I toss and turn in</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.722" end="00:48:22.522" style="s2">bed, unable to sleep. I know she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.022" end="00:48:24.922" style="s2">right, and I know I&#39;m far from</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.522" end="00:48:26.722" style="s2">indifferent toward Daniel. Yet my past</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.922" end="00:48:28.922" style="s2">marriage left scars that make me afraid</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.722" end="00:48:32.522" style="s2">to love again. What answer should I give</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.922" end="00:48:32.522" style="s2">Daniel and myself this time?</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.822" end="00:48:36.522" style="s2">Valentine&#39;s Day arrives a few days</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.222" end="00:48:38.422" style="s2">later. To me, it was supposed to be just</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.522" end="00:48:40.222" style="s2">another ordinary day. I never expected</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.422" end="00:48:42.322" style="s2">to drop by for dinner with two bouquets</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.222" end="00:48:44.022" style="s2">of roses. One bouquet goes to Grandma,</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.322" end="00:48:45.522" style="s2">and the other is handed to me. He</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.022" end="00:48:47.022" style="s2">ensures no one feels left out while</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.522" end="00:48:48.722" style="s2">keeping his conduct gentlemanly in front</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.022" end="00:48:50.922" style="s2">of Grandma. Yet the moment those flowers</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.722" end="00:48:53.022" style="s2">land in my arms, my heart races. Grandma</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.922" end="00:48:54.922" style="s2">beams, then quickly announces plans to</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.022" end="00:48:56.922" style="s2">celebrate with her friends. She grabs</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.922" end="00:48:59.322" style="s2">her bag and leaves, giving us the whole</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.922" end="00:49:01.324" style="s2">place to ourselves. The moment the front</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.322" end="00:49:03.424" style="s2">door clicks shut, the living room</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.324" end="00:49:05.024" style="s2">plunges into silence. I stare at the</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.424" end="00:49:06.124" style="s2">roses avoiding Daniel&#39;s eyes. Once I</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.024" end="00:49:08.024" style="s2">start seriously pondering our</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.124" end="00:49:09.924" style="s2">relationship, feelings I buried refused</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.024" end="00:49:12.124" style="s2">to stay hidden. Daniel gazes at me for a</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.924" end="00:49:14.024" style="s2">moment before gently touching my cheek.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.124" end="00:49:15.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your face is so flushed. You&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.024" end="00:49:17.324" style="s2">running a fever, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.324" end="00:49:19.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His palm radiates warmth. I freeze for a</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.324" end="00:49:19.824" style="s2">second before spasticly turning my head</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.124" end="00:49:21.424" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.824" end="00:49:23.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, are you dodging me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.424" end="00:49:25.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m not. The explanation slips out,</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.624" end="00:49:26.824" style="s2">sounding unconvincing even to my own</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.124" end="00:49:28.924" style="s2">ears. Running away will only keep us</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.824" end="00:49:30.824" style="s2">trapped in uncertainty. I take a deep</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.924" end="00:49:31.924" style="s2">breath and finally meet his eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.824" end="00:49:33.624" style="s2">Daniel, do you happen to have feelings</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.924" end="00:49:34.724" style="s2">for me? He raises a brow, a slow smile</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.624" end="00:49:36.424" style="s2">spreading across his lips.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.724" end="00:49:39.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You finally realized? I thought I&#39;d have</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.424" end="00:49:39.324" style="s2">to wait a little longer.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.624" end="00:49:43.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel&#39;s admission catches me entirely</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.224" end="00:49:45.124" style="s2">off guard. I&#39;ve just ended a failed</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.724" end="00:49:46.924" style="s2">marriage, been betrayed by the person I</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.124" end="00:49:48.824" style="s2">trusted most, and lost myself for a man</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.924" end="00:49:51.324" style="s2">who was never worth it. Does someone</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.824" end="00:49:54.124" style="s2">like me truly deserve his love? But I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.324" end="00:49:55.924" style="s2">a divorcee and I was duped for so long.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.124" end="00:49:57.924" style="s2">What do you even see in me? It causes my</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.924" end="00:49:59.824" style="s2">voice to tremble. Daniel steps closer,</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.924" end="00:50:01.224" style="s2">using both hands to cup my face, forcing</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.824" end="00:50:02.824" style="s2">me to look into his earnest eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.224" end="00:50:03.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like you simply because you are you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.824" end="00:50:06.524" style="s2">It has nothing to do with your</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.624" end="00:50:08.024" style="s2">experience. Claire, you&#39;re wonderful.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.524" end="00:50:08.824" style="s2">You&#39;re far better than you think you</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.024" end="00:50:10.624" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.824" end="00:50:12.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I shake my head out of reflex. Rather</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.624" end="00:50:13.724" style="s2">than making decisions for me, he hands</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.124" end="00:50:15.524" style="s2">the choice right back into my hands.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.724" end="00:50:17.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now it&#39;s my turn to ask. Since you know</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.524" end="00:50:18.124" style="s2">how I feel, would you consider giving us</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.524" end="00:50:20.024" style="s2">a chance?</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.124" end="00:50:21.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My fingers clench tightly. My throat is</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.024" end="00:50:23.124" style="s2">so dry I can barely make a sound. The</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.624" end="00:50:24.824" style="s2">living room falls silent but for our</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.124" end="00:50:26.024" style="s2">breathing. Daniel waits patiently,</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.824" end="00:50:27.224" style="s2">neither pressuring me nor pushing</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.024" end="00:50:29.124" style="s2">forward. Just as the hopeful glimmer in</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.224" end="00:50:30.924" style="s2">his eyes begins to dim, I finally break</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.124" end="00:50:32.824" style="s2">the silence. Daniel, what if one day you</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.924" end="00:50:34.424" style="s2">end up disappointed in me? His breath</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.824" end="00:50:35.624" style="s2">catches as if he&#39;s finally gotten the</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.424" end="00:50:36.324" style="s2">answer he&#39;s been waiting for. He pulls</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.624" end="00:50:37.724" style="s2">me into his arms.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.324" end="00:50:39.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could I ever be? Do you have any</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.724" end="00:50:39.424" style="s2">idea how long I&#39;ve been waiting for this</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.124" end="00:50:40.924" style="s2">day?</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.424" end="00:50:42.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been so long that even he has lost</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.924" end="00:50:44.424" style="s2">count. Lean against his chest, I can</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.224" end="00:50:46.324" style="s2">clearly hear his heart pounding fast. My</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.424" end="00:50:48.724" style="s2">anxiety slowly settled down within his</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.324" end="00:50:52.024" style="s2">hold. Instead of pulling away,</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.724" end="00:50:54.324" style="s2">I slowly raise my arms and hug him back.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.024" end="00:50:56.024" style="s2">Thank you, Daniel.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.324" end="00:50:58.624" style="s2">Thank you for giving me the courage to</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.024" end="00:50:58.624" style="s2">love again.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
